Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.60,0:03:03.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我希望你别在我面前抽。太恶心了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wish you wouldn't do that around me. It's so filthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.52,0:03:04.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别为抽烟的事找我麻烦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't give me a problem about the cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.73,0:03:07.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这习惯太恶心了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's such a filthy habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.19,0:03:08.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.69,0:03:10.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.11,0:03:15.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老天。这太不像话了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Jesus. Oh, this is so appalling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.99,0:03:18.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真不敢相信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.03,0:03:21.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真不敢相信他们给了他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't believe they gave it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.62,0:03:29.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是可悲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, this is pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.71,0:03:31.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在他是个开捷豹的窝囊废。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now he's a loser with a Jaguar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.13,0:03:34.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说真的，他得给谁舔才弄到那玩意儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seriously, who did he have to blow to get that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.92,0:03:39.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}早上好，先生。-威利斯先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Good morning, sir.   -Mr. Willis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.26,0:03:40.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这真是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's really a...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.51,0:03:41.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}特拉斯克先生！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Trask!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.47,0:03:43.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是台好车。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quite a piece of machinery.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.06,0:03:46.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-早上好，哈弗迈耶。  -早上好，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Good morning, Havemeyer.   -Morning to you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.56,0:03:47.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bene!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.94,0:03:49.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好？  -好！太棒了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Bene?   -Bene! Fabulous!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.94,0:03:51.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么太棒了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's fabulous?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.40,0:03:53.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你后面那辆好钢车。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That fine piece of steel you have back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.57,0:03:55.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得我不配。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, you don't think I deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.15,0:03:57.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，先生。恰恰相反。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, sir. On the contrary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.99,0:03:59.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得很棒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think it's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.03,0:04:02.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贝尔德校长怎么能\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why should the headmaster of Baird be seen putt-putting
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.70,0:04:04.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开着破车到处跑？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}around in some junker?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.58,0:04:07.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}事实上，我觉得校董会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In fact, I think the board of trustees have had
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.20,0:04:10.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好久以来第一次有了真正的灵感。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}their first true stroke of inspiration in some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:12.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你，哈弗迈耶。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, thank you, Havemeyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:15.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就当你是真心话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll take that at face value.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.26,0:04:17.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就知道你会这么说，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd expect nothing less, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.01,0:04:19.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}祝你愉快。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.01,0:04:23.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-早上好，亨萨克太太。  -早上好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Morning, Mrs. Hunsaker.   -Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.01,0:04:26.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是谁啊，杀人犯一排？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What have we here, Murderer's Row?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.40,0:04:34.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}刚才那是怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.61,0:04:36.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么。就打个招呼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing. Just saying hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.23,0:04:38.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我喜欢跟特拉斯克校长打招呼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I like to say hello to Headmaster Trask.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.40,0:04:42.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}舒格布什。缆车票和公寓券。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sugarbush. Lift tickets and condo vouchers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.62,0:04:44.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为我们去斯托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought we were going to Stowe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.49,0:04:46.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}舒格布什就是斯托，吉米。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sugarbush is Stowe, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.54,0:04:48.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今年我们要玩个痛快。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This year we're doing it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.25,0:04:50.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感恩节在佛蒙特，圣诞在瑞士……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanksgiving in Vermont, Christmas in Switzerland...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.04,0:04:53.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-在格施塔德过圣诞要花我们……  -“施塔德”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Christmas in Gstaad is gonna cost us...   -"Staad."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.33,0:04:54.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}G不发音。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The "G" is silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.59,0:04:56.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“施塔德”。乔治？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Staad." George?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.42,0:04:57.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-“施塔德”。  -特伦特？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-"Staad."   -Trent?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.80,0:05:00.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-“施塔德”，老兄。  -施塔德怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-"Staad," man.   -So what about Staad?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.18,0:05:01.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。G可能不发音，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine. The "G" may be silent,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.01,0:05:04.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但去那儿至少要三千块。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but it's gonna take at least three grand to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.68,0:05:06.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得跟我爸谈谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll have to talk to my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.56,0:05:09.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}更好的是，让我爸跟你爸谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Better yet, have my father talk to your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.23,0:05:11.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者我爸跟你爸谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or my father talk to your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.56,0:05:15.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这周末回家吗，查斯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You going home this weekend, Chas?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.44,0:05:18.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.65,0:05:21.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要回他妈的爱达荷过感恩节？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You going home to fuckin' Idaho for Thanksgiving?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.45,0:05:22.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是俄勒冈的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm from Oregon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.45,0:05:25.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说他妈的俄勒冈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I meant fuckin' Oregon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.66,0:05:27.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理，你觉得滑雪怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie, how do you feel about skiing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.04,0:05:31.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想不想去佛蒙特那雪白胸脯般的山坡？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You in the mood for the white-bosomed slopes of Vermont?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.54,0:05:35.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有个优惠。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got a deal going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.21,0:05:36.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我朋友打八折。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}20% off for my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.63,0:05:38.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爸安排的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My father set it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.21,0:05:39.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}圣诞在瑞士。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Christmas in Switzerland.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.63,0:05:41.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-施塔德。  -格施塔德。不发G是装腔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Staad.   -Gstaad. Dropping the "G" is phony.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.01,0:05:43.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说大家都说“施塔德”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You said everybody says "Staad."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.68,0:05:45.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去过那儿的人就不会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not if you've been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.22,0:05:48.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}复活节在百慕大，然后肯塔基德比周末。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Easter in Bermuda, then Kentucky Derby weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.68,0:05:50.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们可以把你安排进去，小子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We could fit you in, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.68,0:05:54.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那佛蒙特这些雪白胸脯般的山坡多少钱？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, how much are these white-bosomed slopes of Vermont?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.69,0:05:56.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一千二。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}1,200.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.69,0:06:00.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}包括九道菜的香槟感恩节晚餐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Includes a nine-course, champagne Thanksgiving dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.94,0:06:04.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一千二对我有点贵，哈里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}$1,200 is a little rich for my blood, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.70,0:06:06.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你差多少？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, how short are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.78,0:06:08.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}差多少，哈里？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How short, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.95,0:06:12.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}差到不值得你和乔治费劲去量。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So short it wouldn't be worth the trouble of you and George to measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.71,0:06:14.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但谢谢你问，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But thanks for askin', all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.58,0:06:15.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.67,0:06:17.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你改变主意……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you change your mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.59,0:06:19.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你干嘛那样？你知道他拿助学金的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What'd you do that for? You know he's on aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.92,0:06:23.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大节日里，威利斯，庄园主照例\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On major holidays, Willis, it's customary for the lord of the manor
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.26,0:06:24.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给穷人一点残羹。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to offer drippings to the poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.63,0:06:25.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真是满嘴放屁！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're so full of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.95,0:06:54.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好。罗西太太？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. Mrs. Rossi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.58,0:06:55.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.96,0:06:57.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是来问周末工作的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm here about the weekend job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.67,0:07:01.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}进来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.68,0:07:09.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他长痘吗？他讨厌痘痘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Does he got pimples? He hates pimples.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.35,0:07:10.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗朗辛，安静。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Francine, be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.89,0:07:13.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}痘痘。痘痘。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pimples. Pimples. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.72,0:07:14.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘘！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shush!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.10,0:07:17.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。学校给了我你的名字，但我忘了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry. The school gave me your name, but I've forgotten it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.06,0:07:19.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我叫查理·西姆斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's Charlie Simms.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.77,0:07:21.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你好吗，查理？  -很好，谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-How are you, Charlie?   -Fine, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.78,0:07:22.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这边请。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.70,0:07:28.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你整个周末都有空？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're available the whole weekend?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.99,0:07:30.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.41,0:07:32.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-感恩节不回家？  -不回。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Not going home for Thanksgiving?   -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.33,0:07:33.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.66,0:07:38.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们把他送进退伍军人院，但他讨厌那儿，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They put him in a veteran's home, but he hated it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.75,0:07:40.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我告诉我爸我们接他回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so I told my dad that we'd take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.17,0:07:46.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你进去之前，介意我跟你说几件事吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Before you go in, do you mind my telling you a few things?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.42,0:07:50.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别叫他“先生”，也别问太多问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't "sir" him and don't ask him too many questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.72,0:07:54.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他起身时要是有点晃，你别在意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And if he staggers a little when he gets up, don't pay any attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.72,0:07:59.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理，我看得出这活儿非你莫属。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie, I can tell you're the right person for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.31,0:08:02.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗兰克叔叔也会很喜欢你的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And Uncle Frank's gonna like you a lot, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.61,0:08:07.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这周末你去哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where you gonna be this weekend?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.24,0:08:09.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我们开车去奥尔巴尼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, we're driving to Albany.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.86,0:08:13.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我丈夫唐尼有亲戚在那儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Donny, my husband, has family there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.79,0:08:20.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}汤米你要放进来还是撵出去？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you want Tommy in or out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.79,0:08:22.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}撵出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Leave him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.29,0:08:25.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他又在追赛马场那边那个花里胡哨的妞了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's chasing that Calico ginch from the track houses again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.97,0:08:34.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}骨子里，这人就是块软糖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Down deep, the man is a lump of sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.99,0:08:56.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.74,0:08:58.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别叫我先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't call me sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.71,0:09:00.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.16,0:09:01.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，先生，长官。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean mister, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.88,0:09:05.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎哟，这儿来了个白痴，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh-oh, we got a moron here, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:07.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是，先生……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, mister...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.71,0:09:09.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.17,0:09:12.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}中尉。是，长官……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lieutenant. Yes, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.05,0:09:14.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}中校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lieutenant Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.26,0:09:19.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在部队干了二十六年，还没人一次降我四级。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Twenty-six years on the line, nobody ever busted me four grades before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.06,0:09:21.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚进来，你这白痴！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get in here, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.82,0:09:31.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}靠近点，我要好好看看你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come a little closer. I wanna get a better look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.83,0:09:43.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你皮肤怎么样，孩子？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How's your skin, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.88,0:09:45.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的皮肤，先生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My skin, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.63,0:09:47.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢，老天爷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, for Christ's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.34,0:09:50.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起，我不……——就叫我弗兰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm sorry, I don...   -Just call me Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.30,0:09:51.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}叫我斯莱德先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Call me Mr. Slade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.09,0:09:55.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非叫不可，就叫我上校。就是别叫我先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Call me Colonel, if you must. Just don't call me sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.18,0:09:58.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，上校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.85,0:10:02.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}西姆斯，查尔斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Simms, Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.43,0:10:03.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}高三学生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.90,0:10:05.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你拿助学金吗，西姆斯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You on student aid, Simms?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.73,0:10:07.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，我拿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.77,0:10:09.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“助学金”，说白了就是“骗子”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For "student aid" read "crook."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.03,0:10:14.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你爸卖车载电话，加价三倍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your father peddles car telephones at a 300% markup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.53,0:10:17.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你妈在相机店拿高提成。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your mother works on heavy commission in a camera store.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.33,0:10:20.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从卖咖啡机升上去的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Graduated to it from espresso machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.88,0:10:30.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么了，得了什么痨病快死了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you, dying of some wasting disease?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.67,0:10:34.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，我就在……我就在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I'm right... I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.26,0:10:37.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你人在哪儿我清楚得很。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know exactly where your body is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.43,0:10:41.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我找的是你有没有脑子的迹象。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What I'm lookin' for is some indication of a brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.43,0:10:44.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}橄榄球打多了没戴头盔？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Too much football without a helmet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.48,0:10:48.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈！这是林登说福特的话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hah! Lyndon's line on Gerry Ford.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.15,0:10:53.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}六八年巴黎和会，副审讯官。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Deputy Debriefer, Paris, Peace Talks, '68.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.99,0:10:57.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿了枚银星勋章和一条银杠，把我塞进了G-2。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Snagged the Silver Star and a silver bar. Threw me into G-2.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.91,0:10:59.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}G-2？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}G-2?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.16,0:11:03.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}情报部门，你一点都没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Intelligence, of which you have none.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.50,0:11:08.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你哪儿人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.63,0:11:11.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}俄勒冈州格雷沙姆，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gresham, Oregon,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.09,0:11:14.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:16.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你爸在俄勒冈州格雷沙姆干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What does your daddy do in Gresham, Oregon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.47,0:11:19.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯？数木屑吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm? Count wood chips?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.56,0:11:24.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我继父和我妈开便利店。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My stepfather and my mom run a convenience store.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.48,0:11:27.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真方便。几点开门？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How convenient. What time they open?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.31,0:11:29.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}早上五点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}5:00 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.61,0:11:30.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}几点关门？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Close?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.90,0:11:31.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}凌晨一点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}1:00 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.07,0:11:33.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是勤快人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hard workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.03,0:11:35.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你都把我感动哭了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got me all misty-eyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.12,0:11:42.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你在这鸟不拉屎的小镇干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what are you doing here in this sparrow-fart town?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.04,0:11:46.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在贝尔德上学。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I attend Baird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.79,0:11:49.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在贝尔德上学！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Attend Baird!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.67,0:11:53.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你上贝尔德学校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know you go to the Baird school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:56.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}问题是，你怎么负担得起，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Point is, how do you afford it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.42,0:12:00.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就算有助学金，家里还拼命卖玉米豆？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}even with the student aid and the folks back home hustlin' corn nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.18,0:12:06.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我拿了“美国青年”优秀奖学金。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I won a Young American merit scholarship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.31,0:12:07.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呼哈！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hoo-ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.98,0:12:13.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}荣耀，荣耀，哈利路亚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Glory, glory Hallelujah
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.94,0:12:17.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}荣耀，荣耀，哈利路亚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Glory, glory Hallelujah
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.87,0:12:22.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁在那儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.53,0:12:25.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个小贱货？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That little piece of tail?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.54,0:12:30.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让她出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get her outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.01,0:12:40.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.05,0:12:44.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真不敢相信他们是我的血亲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can't believe they're my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.48,0:12:53.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}智商跟树懒一样，举止像报丧女妖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}IQ of sloths and the manners of banshees.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.61,0:12:55.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是修理工，她是家庭主妇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's a mechanic, she's a homemaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.07,0:12:58.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他懂车，还不如选美皇后懂，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He knows as much about cars as a beauty queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.70,0:13:01.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她烤的饼干，味道像蝶形螺母。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and she bakes cookies, taste like wing nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:05.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至于那几个小崽子，全是蠢货。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As for the tots, they're twits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.04,0:13:08.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你皮肤怎么样，孩子？我喜欢我的助手体面点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How's your skin, son? I like my aides to be presentable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.04,0:13:13.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.71,0:13:15.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我长过几颗痘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've had a few zits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.63,0:13:18.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我室友把他的倩碧借给我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But my roommate, he lent me his Clinique
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.13,0:13:21.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为他来自栗树山，他有……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because he's from Chestnut Hill and he's got...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.38,0:13:24.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《我的皮肤史》，作者查尔斯·西姆斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"The History of My Skin," by Charles Simms.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.22,0:13:27.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在跟我摆架子吗，小不点？嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You patronizing me, peewee? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.72,0:13:31.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跟我扯那套预科学校的废话？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You givin' me that old prep school palaver?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.81,0:13:34.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贝尔德学校！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Baird School!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.56,0:13:38.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一群流鼻涕的小屁孩穿着花呢外套\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A bunch of runny-nosed snots in tweed jackets
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.11,0:13:41.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}个个学着当乔治·布什。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}all studyin' to be George Bush.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.70,0:13:45.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.78,0:13:48.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校，我记得布什总统上的是安多佛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I believe President Bush went to Andover, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.83,0:13:54.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在挑我刺吗，小子？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You sharpshootin' me, punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.50,0:13:57.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是在这么干吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that what you're doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.50,0:14:00.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别挑我的刺。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't you sharpshoot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.05,0:14:03.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你给我做四十个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll give me 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.43,0:14:06.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再做四十个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then you're gonna give me 40 more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.18,0:14:09.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后你去厨房帮厨，刷油锅！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then you're gonna pull K.P., the grease pit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.93,0:14:15.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要让你在士兵的脏活里滚，滚到分不清东南西北！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll rub your nose in enlisted men's crud till you don't know which end is up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.06,0:14:17.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.82,0:14:19.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.11,0:14:21.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想要什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.44,0:14:23.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你什么意思，我想要什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you mean, what do I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.53,0:14:24.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在这儿想干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you want here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.49,0:14:29.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想要份工作。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.12,0:14:32.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}工作！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A job!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.20,0:14:34.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，我想要份工作，好挣点，你知道，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I want a job so I can make, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.33,0:14:36.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回家过圣诞的机票钱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}my plane fare home for Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.13,0:14:41.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，天哪，你这话真感人！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, God, you're touching!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.35,0:14:56.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们曾在岸边跳华尔兹\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They used to waltz on the banks
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.60,0:15:00.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在浩荡的密西西比河旁\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of the mighty Mississippi
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.19,0:15:03.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}整夜相爱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Loving the whole night through
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.20,0:15:08.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直到河船上的赌徒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Till the riverboat gambler
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.12,0:15:12.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出去大赚一笔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Went off to make a killin'
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.20,0:15:14.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再把它带回来给你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And bring it on back to you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.25,0:15:18.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还在这儿啊，穷鬼？嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Still here, poormouth? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.75,0:15:24.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}便利店，狗屁！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Convenience store, my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.17,0:15:29.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}向乡巴佬兜售墨西哥辣椒蘸酱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hustlin' jalapeno dips to the appleseeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.22,0:15:32.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.76,0:15:34.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}解散。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.27,0:15:38.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}解散！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dismissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.53,0:15:52.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊万杰琳\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Evangeline
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.37,0:15:54.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗西太太？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mrs. Rossi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.20,0:15:57.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理，我们在楼上！上来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie, we're up here! Come on up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.21,0:16:02.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是唐尼。——嗨，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-This is Donny.   -Hey, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.21,0:16:04.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.84,0:16:07.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗西太太，我感觉我搞砸了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mrs. Rossi, I got the feelin' I screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.05,0:16:10.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你不可能搞砸的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you couldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.30,0:16:11.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}面试很糟糕。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was a bad interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.93,0:16:13.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那根本不算面试，查理。就是你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was no interview, Charlie. You're it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.14,0:16:17.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有你来了。这活儿你得接。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're the only one that showed up. You have to take the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.27,0:16:21.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他经常睡觉。你可以看电视，给女朋友打电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He sleeps a lot. You can watch television, call your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.44,0:16:24.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我保证，轻松赚三百块。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I promise you, an easy 300 bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.24,0:16:28.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可没觉得这钱好赚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't get an easy feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.66,0:16:33.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他就是嘴上凶，其实不咬人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His bark is worse than his bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.74,0:16:38.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他曾是个了不起的军人，真正的英雄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was a great soldier, a real hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:41.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这人相处久了你会喜欢他的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The man grows on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.88,0:16:43.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到周日晚上，你们就会成好朋友了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By Sunday night, you'll be best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.21,0:16:48.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理，求你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.18,0:16:51.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想和我丈夫出去几天，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to get away with my husband for a few days,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.26,0:16:53.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可弗兰克叔叔不肯跟我们一起去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and Uncle Frank won't come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.10,0:16:56.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}六个月前，他有时还能分清明暗，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Six months ago, he could sometimes tell light from dark,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.02,0:16:58.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但现在什么都看不见了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but now there's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.98,0:17:01.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有个人在边上，以防万一，我会安心些。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just feel better having someone else around just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.49,0:17:09.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求你了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.20,0:17:14.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，罗西太太。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, Mrs. Rossi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.70,0:17:15.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.29,0:17:18.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.37,0:17:19.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来吧，你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come here, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.09,0:17:29.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.97,0:17:32.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查斯。查斯，等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chas. Chas, hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.22,0:17:35.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—最近怎么样？  -—挺好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-How you doin'?   -I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.14,0:17:37.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.89,0:17:39.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这本不能借出。这是预留的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This can't go out. This is on reserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.56,0:17:45.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.56,0:17:48.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我今晚需要这本书\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need the book tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.98,0:17:51.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明早要跟自以为是的普雷斯顿做感恩节测验。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for a Thanksgiving quiz with big-shit Preston in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.95,0:17:54.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我知道。所以他才把它设为预留。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I know. That's why he put it on reserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.41,0:17:55.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我们唯一的一本。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is our only copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.70,0:17:58.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查斯，我要通宵熬夜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chas, I'm pullin' an all-nighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:18:00.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有那本书我就死定了，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Without that book I'm dead, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.71,0:18:06.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是七点半前还不回来，我就完蛋了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If it's not back by 7:30, it's gonna be my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.42,0:18:08.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我保证。我保证。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I promise. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:19.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—明白了吗？  -—明白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Got it?   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.90,0:18:36.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一下。我得锁门。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just a second. I gotta lock up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.83,0:18:42.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.75,0:18:46.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，你是不是也等不及离开这破地方了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God, can you wait to get out of this dump or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.13,0:18:54.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们这次又去哪儿滑雪？糖面包山还是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where you guys going skiing again? Sugarloaf or...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.05,0:18:56.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是布什，查斯，是舒格布什。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's bush, Chas, Sugarbush.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.06,0:19:08.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是我的好小子们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's my boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.81,0:19:10.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.86,0:19:13.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小声点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep your voice down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.82,0:19:16.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我早上再告诉你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll tell you about it in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.70,0:19:20.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.12,0:19:22.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}汉萨克太太，祝您愉快？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mrs. Hunsaker, have a nice day?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.70,0:19:24.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乔治，怎么这么吵？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}George, why all the noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.25,0:19:28.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是汉萨克！快跑！快跑！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's Hunsaker! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.04,0:19:31.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是在跟查斯闹着玩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was just messin' around with Chas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.25,0:19:32.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚上好，查尔斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good evening, Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.51,0:19:33.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，汉萨克太太。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, Mrs. Hunsaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.43,0:19:41.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—那是怎么回事？  -—我不知道，夫人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What was that?   -I don't know, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.22,0:19:43.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那些男孩是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who were those boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.52,0:19:45.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—哦，谁知道呢？  -—他们在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, who knows?   -What were they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.52,0:19:47.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查尔斯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charles?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.94,0:19:50.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这条围巾是你自己织的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you make this scarf yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.11,0:19:52.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是，乔治，我买的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, George, I bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.61,0:19:55.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—因为真漂亮。真的。  -—谢谢你，乔治。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-'Cause it's a beauty. It really is.   -Thank you, George.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.53,0:19:58.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}万一感恩节假期前我见不到你，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In case I don't see you before the Thanksgiving holidays,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.49,0:20:00.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不如给我一个大大的拥抱吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}why don't you give me one of your big hugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.41,0:20:01.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—哦，乔治！  -—求你了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, George!   -Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.78,0:20:03.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—晚上好，孩子们。  -—走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Good evening, boys.   -Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.41,0:20:04.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见，汉萨克太太。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goodbye, Mrs. Hunsaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.47,0:20:29.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}特拉斯克先生是我们无畏的领袖，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Trask is our fearless leader,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.60,0:20:33.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一位博学之人，一个如饥似渴的读者。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a man of learning, a voracious reader.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.48,0:20:38.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他能用古希腊语背诵《伊利亚特》\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He could recite the Iliad in ancient Greek
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.40,0:20:42.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一边在潺潺的小溪里钓鳟鱼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}while fishing for trout in a rippling creek.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.99,0:20:48.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他富有智慧，判断稳健，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Endowed with wisdom, of judgment sound,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.50,0:20:52.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尽管如此，关于他的疑问仍层出不穷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}nevertheless about him the questions abound.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.42,0:21:01.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}特拉斯克先生是怎么做成这么棒的交易的呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How does Mr. Trask make such wonderful deals?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.51,0:21:06.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}校董们为什么给他买捷豹轮子？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why did the trustees buy him Jaguar wheels?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.10,0:21:08.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他没耍阴谋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He wasn't conniving.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.52,0:21:11.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他也没粗俗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He wasn't crass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.60,0:21:13.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他只是撅起嘴唇\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He merely puckered his lips
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.69,0:21:19.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亲了他们的屁股！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and kissed their ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.55,0:21:40.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}继续。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.80,0:21:45.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再来一个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.14,0:21:47.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再来一个，来啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One more, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.16,0:22:08.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去你的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.46,0:22:18.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}西姆斯先生，威利斯先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Simms, Mr. Willis.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.92,0:22:26.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}汉萨克太太说，你们两位先生昨晚在有利位置\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mrs. Hunsaker says that you gentlemen were at a vantage point last night
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.34,0:22:29.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能看到是谁干的这桩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to observe who was responsible for this
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.60,0:22:31.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恶作剧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}stunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.90,0:22:39.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.48,0:22:42.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的说不上来，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I really couldn't tell you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.11,0:22:47.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我好像看到有人在摆弄路灯，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought I saw someone fooling with the lamppost,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.32,0:22:51.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我聚焦看清时，人已经不见了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but by the time I pulled focus, they were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.58,0:22:54.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}西姆斯先生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Simms?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.75,0:22:57.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说不准。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I couldn't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.63,0:23:03.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那辆车不只是我的财产。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That automobile is not just a possession of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.72,0:23:08.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那辆车是校董会送给我的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That automobile was presented to me by the board of trustees.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.72,0:23:13.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它象征着这所学校所著称的卓越标准，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is a symbol of the standard of excellence for which this school is known,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.85,0:23:16.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不允许它被玷污。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I will not have it tarnished.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.65,0:23:18.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}车吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The automobile?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.94,0:23:23.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是标准，威利斯先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The standard, Mr. Willis.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.66,0:23:28.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的立场是什么，西姆斯先生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's your position, Mr. Simms?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.66,0:23:30.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于什么，先生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On what, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.99,0:23:33.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于维护贝尔德的声誉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On preserving the reputation of Baird.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.58,0:23:35.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我支持贝尔德。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm for Baird.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.66,0:23:37.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，是谁干的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then, who did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.67,0:23:40.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的说不准。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I really couldn't say for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.47,0:23:47.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.52,0:23:58.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}周一第一件事，我要召开一次特别会议\N{\rEN\blur0.8}First thing Monday, I'm convening a special session
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.19,0:24:00.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}由师生纪律委员会出席。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of the student-faculty disciplinary committee.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.61,0:24:03.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为这件事关系到全校，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As this is a matter which concerns the whole school,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.32,0:24:06.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全体学生都要到场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the entire student body will be present.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.20,0:24:08.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不上课，不搞活动。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There will be no classes, no activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.78,0:24:14.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在听证会结束前，学校一切事务停摆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing will transpire at this institution until that proceeding is concluded.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.54,0:24:19.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果到时候我们的进展和现在一样，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And if, at that time, we are no further along than we are now,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.79,0:24:23.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就把你们俩都开除。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will expel you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.97,0:24:31.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}威利斯先生，你先出去一下好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Willis, would you excuse us?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.10,0:24:37.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感恩节快乐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have a nice Thanksgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.56,0:24:41.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。你也是，威利斯先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you. You, too, Mr. Willis.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.31,0:24:42.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.41,0:24:51.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}西姆斯先生，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Simms,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.99,0:24:56.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还没跟你说完。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not quite through with you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.00,0:25:07.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个职位少有的特权之一就是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One of the few perks of this office is that
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.84,0:25:12.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有权自行处理某些事务。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am empowered to handle certain matters on my own asI see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.76,0:25:16.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你明白吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.72,0:25:18.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-明白，先生。  -很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yes, sir.   -Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.68,0:25:21.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈佛招生办主任和我有个约定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Dean of Admissions at Harvard and I have an arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.85,0:25:25.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除了贝尔德提交的常规申请名单，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Along with the usual sheaf of applicants submitted by Baird,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.19,0:25:30.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其中三分之二基本保证录取，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of which virtually two-thirds are guaranteed admittance,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.95,0:25:32.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我加一个名字，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I add one name,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.70,0:25:38.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个出众但家境贫寒的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}somebody who's a standout and yet underprivileged.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.41,0:25:43.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个付不起剑桥学费和食宿的学生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A student who cannot afford to pay the board and tuition in Cambridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.13,0:25:49.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道今年我替谁起草了推荐信吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you know on whose behalf I drafted a memo this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.84,0:25:51.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知道，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.01,0:25:53.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.18,0:25:55.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你，西姆斯先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You, Mr. Simms.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.93,0:26:01.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在你能告诉我是谁干的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now can you tell me who did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.81,0:26:05.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不能，先生，我不能。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, sir, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.73,0:26:09.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你周末好好想想，西姆斯先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You take the weekend to think about it, Mr. Simms.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.86,0:26:13.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.78,0:26:18.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他说什么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What'd he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.83,0:26:20.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-没什么。  -什么叫没什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Nothin'.   -What do you mean, nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.00,0:26:23.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他说的一样。只是又说了一遍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He said the same thing. He just said it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.92,0:26:25.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道他在干什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what he's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.63,0:26:28.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在对我们一个唱红脸一个唱白脸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's good-cop, bad-coppin' us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.84,0:26:30.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他知道我是老派。你是边缘人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He knows I'm old guard. You're fringe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.13,0:26:33.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他会对我施压，对你软磨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's gonna bear down on me and soft-soap you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.84,0:26:37.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他对你软磨了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did he try to soft-soap you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.93,0:26:39.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.85,0:26:40.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.06,0:26:45.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查斯，我察觉到你有轻微的恐慌脉冲。你在恐慌吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chas, I detect a slight panic pulse from you. Are you panicking?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.48,0:26:46.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是，有一点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.94,0:26:48.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托。你是拿奖学金的，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. You're on scholarship, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.23,0:26:51.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.53,0:26:54.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是从俄勒冈来贝尔德拿奖学金的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're on scholarship from Oregon at Baird.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.82,0:26:57.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你离家很远，查斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a long way from home, Chas.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.78,0:27:00.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那跟这有什么关系？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's that got to do with anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.37,0:27:03.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道那边是怎么运作的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know how it works out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.91,0:27:05.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但这里是怎么运作的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But how it works here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.54,0:27:07.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们抱团。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.33,0:27:09.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管怎样，我们对抗他们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's us against them, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.96,0:27:11.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不撇清自己。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We don't cover our ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.88,0:27:13.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不告诉父母。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We don't tell our parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.97,0:27:15.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对所有人都守口如瓶！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stonewall everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.72,0:27:21.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最重要的是，永远永远\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And above all, never, ever
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.35,0:27:24.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别让我们任何人孤立无援。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}leave any of us twisting in the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.10,0:27:27.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.98,0:27:30.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那跟我拿奖学金有什么关系？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What does that have to do with me being on scholarship?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.90,0:27:32.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.82,0:27:35.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是想让你跟上情况，孩子，就这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just tryin' to bring you up to speed, kid, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.70,0:27:37.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.03,0:27:42.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟你说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.62,0:27:45.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我几个小时想清楚对策，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me a few hours to figure out the moves,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.46,0:27:47.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚打电话到佛蒙特找我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and call me tonight in Vermont.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.92,0:27:51.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会在糖灌木旅馆，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be at the Sugarbush lodge, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.13,0:27:53.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.84,0:27:56.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.38,0:27:58.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，应该没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.51,0:28:01.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.39,0:28:06.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尽量让他每天只喝四杯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Try to keep him down to four drinks a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.89,0:28:09.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能给他压到四十杯，就算干得不错了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you can keep him down to 40, you're doin' good.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.81,0:28:12.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们会尽量给他掺点水。你知道怎么弄吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We try to water them down alittle. Do you know how to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.36,0:28:14.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}路很远，亲爱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a long ride, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.90,0:28:16.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把包放进车里，我马上出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get the bags in the car. I'll be right out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.99,0:28:20.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈妈，妈妈，别忘了带弗兰克叔叔去散步。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mommy, Mommy, don't forget Uncle Frank's walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.16,0:28:24.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.96,0:28:29.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每天得让他出去透透气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have to air him out a little every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.25,0:28:33.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你先去后面熟悉一下环境吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't you go on back there, get yourself oriented?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.05,0:28:36.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一会儿出来，把电话号码什么的给你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll come out in a minute, give you telephone numbers and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.26,0:28:43.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非我确定，不然我不会那么干的，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I wouldn't try a thing like that unless I knew, would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.47,0:28:45.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我跟她说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just let me speak to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.56,0:28:47.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好啊，美人。是你吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, beautiful. Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.73,0:28:49.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，我们昨天聊过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, we spoke yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.36,0:28:56.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}午饭喝了杯葡萄酒？你声音有点沙哑。嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have a glass of wine with lunch? You sound a little dusky. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.82,0:29:00.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一下，甜心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just a minute, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.16,0:29:03.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你回来了，嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're back, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.99,0:29:06.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真执着！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tenacious!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.41,0:29:09.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把我的军礼服拿出来。在衣柜的挂衣袋里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out my dress blues. They're in a garment bag in the closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.50,0:29:10.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看梳妆台最上面的抽屉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Check the top dresser drawer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.08,0:29:14.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把肩章拿出来装上，左右肩各一个，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take out the shoulder boards and affix them, shoulders right and left,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.59,0:29:17.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}越快越好。也就是现在。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}ASAP. That means now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.13,0:29:19.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.97,0:29:22.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉让你久等了，甜心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry to keep you waiting, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.89,0:29:25.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是那种喜欢匆匆忙忙的人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not the kind of guy who likes to rush things,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.51,0:29:28.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我要赶洛根机场四点的飞机，我望着窗外，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I'm catchin' a 4:00 at Logan, I'm lookin' out my window,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.48,0:29:30.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一辆出租车都看不见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and there's not a taxi in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.40,0:29:32.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What happened to Chet?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.02,0:29:34.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他还没舍得装个无线电？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He didn't invest in a radio yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.23,0:29:36.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.94,0:29:39.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就让你司机去办。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, get your driver on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.74,0:29:41.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}叫他快点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell him to get a move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.11,0:29:44.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.83,0:29:49.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那种撩人的嗓音，一定得配副好身材。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Some kind of body has got to go with that bedroom voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.29,0:29:51.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哪天我顺路过去，好好看看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One day I'm gonna swing by, get a better look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.42,0:29:53.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.46,0:29:56.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.51,0:30:01.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的旅行箱在床底下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My Valpak's underneath the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.76,0:30:02.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.14,0:30:05.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把肩章装到军礼服上，叠好放进去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put the boards on the blues and fold 'em in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.97,0:30:09.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要出门吗，中校？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are we going someplace, Colonel?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.52,0:30:11.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这跟你有关系吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What business is that of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.98,0:30:13.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别耸肩，白痴。我看不见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't shrug, imbecile. I'm blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.15,0:30:16.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把你的肢体语言留给小妞们吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Save your body language for the bimbi.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.27,0:30:18.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，把我的装备拿出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, get my gear out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.07,0:30:22.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗朗辛，上车。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Francine, get in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.95,0:30:26.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快三点了。该死的原始人一家还没走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's almost 3:00. The goddamn Flintstones haven't left yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.16,0:30:30.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}威利·罗西必须上车。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Willie Rossi must go in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.08,0:30:33.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗西太太又过来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here comes Mrs. Rossi now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.66,0:30:34.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.58,0:30:37.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她今天已经跟我道别三次了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She said goodbye to me three times today.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.09,0:30:41.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她怎么了，分离焦虑吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What has she got, separation anxiety?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.51,0:30:43.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在门口拦住她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cut her off at the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.09,0:30:47.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，亲爱的。再见，亲爱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, honey. Bye, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.35,0:30:54.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真希望你能跟我们一起去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wish you were coming with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.64,0:30:55.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.15,0:30:57.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许下次吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.11,0:31:04.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-开车小心。  -好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Drive carefully now.   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.11,0:31:08.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理，我们会住在这里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie, this is where we'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.12,0:31:13.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}祝你好运，查理。别让他喝太多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good luck, Charlie. Don't let him drink too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.12,0:31:18.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回头见，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See you, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.59,0:31:22.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有，不许打900开头的电话。他爱说下流话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And no 900 numbers. He loves to talk dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.85,0:31:32.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，开工吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.15,0:31:44.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}L形扣子弄不好？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}L-buckles givin' you trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.15,0:31:48.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没参加过童子军吗，傻小子？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Never in the Boy Scouts, sluggo?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.36,0:31:50.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我升到过初级童子军。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I made Tenderfoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.24,0:31:52.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}初级个屁！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tenderfoot, my foot!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.24,0:31:54.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}便利店里的妈宝男。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Convenience store mama's boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.45,0:31:56.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来，让我看看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here. Let me take a look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.25,0:32:00.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再碰我一下，我杀了你，你个小杂种！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Touch me again, I'll kill you, you little son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.09,0:32:03.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我碰你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I touch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.59,0:32:06.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.22,0:32:12.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的肩章在梳妆台最上面的抽屉里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My shoulder boards are in the top dresser drawer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.56,0:32:13.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去拿，孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get them, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.10,0:32:16.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}带银色橡树叶的那种肩章。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The epaulets with the silver oak leaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.87,0:32:35.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are these the...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.20,0:32:38.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。出租车来了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good. Taxi come yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.29,0:32:41.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}中校，我们要去哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel, where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.96,0:32:43.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要去哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.00,0:32:46.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怪胎秀大本营。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Freak show central.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.30,0:32:48.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那是哪儿？  -纽约市。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Where's that?   -New York City.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.01,0:32:52.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就在纽约，孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's in New York, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.55,0:32:54.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}纽约州。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}New York State.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.72,0:32:57.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗西太太没跟我说过要去哪儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mrs. Rossi didn't say anything to me about going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.60,0:32:58.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她忘了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.02,0:33:01.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们该不该给她打个电话，因为我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Should we call her, 'cause I...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.77,0:33:03.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你开玩笑吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.36,0:33:07.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打给她？等他们开着他那辆破车到奥尔巴尼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Call her? By the time they get to Albany in that Hupmobile he drives
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.32,0:33:09.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}萨拉托加赛马场都开幕了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it'll be opening day at Saratoga.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.86,0:33:11.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}中校，我不能去纽约市。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel, I can't go to New York City.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.91,0:33:12.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么不能？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.24,0:33:15.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}纽约……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}New York...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.20,0:33:18.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}纽约责任太大了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}New York's too much responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.20,0:33:19.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊，责任！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, responsibility!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.08,0:33:22.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我第一个排里有一堆十七岁的毛头小子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had a lot of 17-year-olds in my first platoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.83,0:33:25.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我把他们照顾得好好的。都弄好了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I took care of them. All set!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.34,0:33:28.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看起来怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How do I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.59,0:33:32.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}票。钱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tickets. Money.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.01,0:33:34.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}演讲稿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.10,0:33:38.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟着林登混那会儿的华盛顿老笑话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Old Washington joke from my days with Lyndon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.73,0:33:42.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就知道交通不成问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I knew I could count on transportation.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.81,0:33:44.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准备好了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.57,0:33:49.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这儿不是板门店。简单说声“是”就行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is not Panmunjom. A simple yes will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.28,0:33:52.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-呃……  -好！给你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Um...   -Good! Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.28,0:33:53.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快！利索点，小子！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on! Hop to, son!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.28,0:33:57.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你走我前面。走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're in front of me. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.08,0:34:00.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}汤姆斯特，过来，伙计。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tomster, come here, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.67,0:34:03.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来呀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.08,0:34:05.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来，汤姆斯特，过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here, Tomster, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.13,0:34:08.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}汤姆斯特，汤姆斯特。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tomster, Tomster. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.42,0:34:12.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}记住，拿不准的时候，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Remember, when in doubt,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.26,0:34:14.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就他妈干。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.81,0:34:20.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下午好，先生。我们去哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good afternoon, sir. Where's our destination?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.35,0:34:23.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的目的地，纽约市，勇士的家园！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Our destination, New York City, home of the brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.48,0:34:25.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们订两张去纽约的穿梭航班。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We got two for the shuttle to New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.56,0:34:28.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我才不坐什么穿梭航班。看看那些票。头等舱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not shuttling anywhere. Look at those tickets. First class.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.61,0:34:30.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是，先生，头等舱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, sir, first class.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.40,0:34:32.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校，你给我买了机票？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel, you bought me a ticket?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.45,0:34:34.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从没说过我要去纽约。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I never said I'd go to New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.41,0:34:38.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么，你个窝囊废，只肯照章办事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, what are you, some kind of chicken-shit, sticks to job description only?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.41,0:34:40.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}46号登机口，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gate 46, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.37,0:34:41.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}忙你的吧，小伙子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As you were, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.83,0:34:43.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.42,0:34:44.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}门在哪个方向？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which way's the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.04,0:34:49.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你瞎了吗？你瞎了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you blind? Are you blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.25,0:34:50.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.42,0:34:52.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你他妈的老抓我胳膊干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then why do you keep grabbin' my goddamn arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.30,0:34:55.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我扶着你胳膊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I take your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.14,0:35:02.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-对不起。  -别道歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm sorry.   -Don't be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.31,0:35:04.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你懂什么，一辈子就看MTV？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How would you know, watchin' MTV all your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.89,0:35:06.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-先生们？  -嗯！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Gentlemen?   -Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.44,0:35:11.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-杰克丹尼。  -没问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Jack Daniels.   -You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.53,0:35:15.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有健怡斯莱斯汽水。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And Diet Slice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.49,0:35:16.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老牌的健怡斯莱斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The old Diet Slice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.91,0:35:18.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再来杯水。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And a water.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.45,0:35:20.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-谢谢你，达芙妮。  -好的，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Thank you, Daphne.   -Certainly, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.96,0:35:30.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嗯！  -你怎么知道她名字？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Mmm!   -How did you know her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.34,0:35:35.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她身上喷的是弗洛里斯香水。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, she's wearin' Floris.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.93,0:35:37.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是英国古龙水。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's an English cologne.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.01,0:35:42.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可她的口音一听就是加州小妞。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But her voice is California chickie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.10,0:35:46.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个加州小妞想当英国淑女。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, California chickie bucking for English lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.02,0:35:48.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我叫她达芙妮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I call her Daphne.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.65,0:35:54.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你那个小东西将来可大有前途。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, big things may happen to that little thing of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.53,0:35:57.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，上校，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, Colonel,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.66,0:36:01.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我会把你送到纽约，行吗？  -嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'll get you to New York, all right?   -Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.12,0:36:04.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后我就得掉头回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then I'm gonna have to turn around and come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.41,0:36:07.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎，查克，该干嘛干嘛吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, Chuck, you gotta do what you gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.54,0:36:10.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是查理，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.63,0:36:11.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者查尔斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.13,0:36:14.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。不过我不怪你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry. I can't blame you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.51,0:36:15.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查克这名字……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chuck is a...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.43,0:36:21.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我们去纽约干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, why are we going to New York?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.80,0:36:25.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该你知道的才会让你知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All information will be given on a need-to-know basis.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.73,0:36:27.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呼啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hoo-ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.60,0:36:30.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达芙妮呢？叫她过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's Daphne? Let's get her down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.82,0:36:35.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她在后面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.15,0:36:37.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}空姐在机尾。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A tail's in the tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.95,0:36:40.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.86,0:36:42.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，可我还能闻到她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, but I still smell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.45,0:36:47.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Women.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.00,0:36:50.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能说什么呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What can you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.17,0:36:53.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁造出来的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who made 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.80,0:36:57.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上帝他妈的是个天才。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God must have been a fuckin' genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.64,0:37:03.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}头发……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The hair...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.47,0:37:06.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}人家说头发就是一切，你知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They say the hair is everything, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.60,0:37:12.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有没有把鼻子埋进一座卷发山，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have you ever buried your nose in a mountain of curls
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.81,0:37:15.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只想一睡不醒？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and just wanted to go to sleep forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.65,0:37:19.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者嘴唇，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or lips,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.49,0:37:23.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当它们相触，你的嘴唇就像\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and when they touched, yours were like
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.57,0:37:26.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那第一口酒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that first swallow of wine
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.33,0:37:29.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在你刚穿过沙漠之后。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}after you just crossed the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.46,0:37:34.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奶子！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tits!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.84,0:37:36.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呼啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hoo-ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.05,0:37:39.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大的，小的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Big ones, little ones,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.51,0:37:45.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乳头直勾勾对着你，像秘密探照灯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}nipples staring right out at you like secret searchlights.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.05,0:37:47.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.81,0:37:51.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有腿……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And legs...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.52,0:37:55.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不管它们是希腊石柱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't care if they're Greek columns
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.90,0:37:57.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是二手施坦威钢琴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or secondhand Steinways.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.44,0:38:00.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}两腿之间那地方，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's between 'em,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.95,0:38:04.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}通往天堂的护照。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}passport to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.53,0:38:07.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得喝一杯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.96,0:38:13.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错，西姆斯先生，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, Mr. Simms,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.42,0:38:19.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这整个世界上只有两个音节值得听。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}there's only two syllables in this whole wide world worth hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.22,0:38:26.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小逼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pussy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.55,0:38:28.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.43,0:38:32.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在听我说话吗，小子？我这是在给你传授至理名言。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you listening to me, son? I'm givin' you pearls here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.23,0:38:35.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我猜你真的很喜欢女人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I guess you really like women.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.10,0:38:38.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，胜过一切！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, above all things!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.57,0:38:47.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}遥不可及的第二名\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A very, very distant second
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.91,0:38:51.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是法拉利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is a Ferrari.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.13,0:39:00.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.26,0:39:04.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把手给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.68,0:39:09.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这只是你学习的开始，小子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is just the start of your education, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.61,0:39:26.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呼啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hoo-ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.36,0:39:28.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们到哪儿了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.78,0:39:30.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们到哪儿了，嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where are we, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.70,0:39:33.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一切文明事物的中心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The cynosure of all things civilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.08,0:39:35.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}华尔道夫酒店。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Waldorf-Astoria.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.25,0:39:40.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理，我上次来这儿，是跟布鲁塞尔的一个G-2情报官一起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The last time I was here, Charlie, was with a G-2 from Brussels.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.80,0:39:42.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他有一辆法拉利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Had a Ferrari.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.42,0:39:45.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我每天给那混蛋开车门。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every day I held the door open for the fucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.72,0:39:47.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他连搭个车都不肯让我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Never even offered me a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.97,0:39:49.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去他妈的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, fuck him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.97,0:39:52.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他死了，我瞎了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's dead and I'm blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.81,0:39:57.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把这话传出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Spread the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.60,0:39:58.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢您，长官。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.73,0:40:00.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那情报会如期送来吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the intelligence will be forthcoming?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.73,0:40:01.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}长官？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.98,0:40:03.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于应召女郎那件事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On the escort scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.07,0:40:06.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是，长官。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.53,0:40:08.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎您来华尔道夫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And welcome to the Waldorf.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.57,0:40:09.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢，朋友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gracias, amigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.66,0:40:13.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}波多黎各人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Puerto Ricans.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.20,0:40:14.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一向是最好的步兵。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Always made the best infantrymen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.42,0:40:23.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.68,0:40:31.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我又回家了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm home again.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.85,0:40:35.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}帮我清点一下这些，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me an inventory on this, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.27,0:40:43.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行吧，我在哪儿，亚洲吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, where am I, in Asia?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.52,0:40:46.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他跟我说电话在房间另一头，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He told me the phone was on the other side of the room, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.78,0:40:47.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}窗户旁边？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By the windows?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.57,0:40:50.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.66,0:40:53.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.66,0:40:55.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可以开工了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're in business.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.88,0:41:02.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我接橡树厅。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get me the Oak Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.80,0:41:06.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}清点得怎么样了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How's that inventory comin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.17,0:41:09.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有占边威士忌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's Jim Beam
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.01,0:41:12.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有早时报威士忌。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and Early Times.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.76,0:41:14.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}军需官又在揩油了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quartermaster's on the take again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.76,0:41:17.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，谢尔顿或者麦克在吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello. Is Sheldon or Mack there?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.35,0:41:21.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是弗兰克·斯莱德中校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is Lieutenant Colonel Frank Slade.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.81,0:41:25.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以前是常客，常跟加比施将军一起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I used to be a regular. I used to come in with a General Garbisch.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.40,0:41:30.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，那大概是因为他葬在阿灵顿，在六尺深的地下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, that's probably because he's at Arlington, six feet under.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.74,0:41:34.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听好了，我要一张两人桌，别给我西伯利亚那种角落位，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen up. I want a table for two, and I don't mean Siberia,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.62,0:41:35.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}8点15分。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}8:15.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.87,0:41:38.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把那些小瓶子都收走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Clear them little bottles off.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.79,0:41:42.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我挂了电话以后，打给海曼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And when I get off the phone, call up Hyman.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.83,0:41:45.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉他我要满墙都是约翰·丹尼尔斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell him I want it wall to wall with John Daniels.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.13,0:41:48.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}您是说杰克丹尼吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't you mean Jack Daniels?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.13,0:41:52.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对你来说是杰克，孩子。等你跟我一样认识他那么久……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He may be Jack to you, son. But when you've known him as long as I have...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.97,0:41:54.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开玩笑的。喂！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's a joke. Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.55,0:41:57.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是弗兰克·斯莱德中校。我要一辆加长轿车，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is Lieutenant Colonel Frank Slade. I would like a limo,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.68,0:41:58.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}8点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}8:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.77,0:42:07.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你喝什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you drinkin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.86,0:42:10.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不喝，谢谢。我不碰酒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing, thanks. I don't use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.11,0:42:12.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}酒有什么好碰的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's useful about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.53,0:42:17.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。听着，中校，我得走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. Listen, Colonel, I have to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.79,0:42:20.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你去哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where you goin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.37,0:42:24.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回学校。我有一些非常重要的事要处理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Back to school. I've got some real important stuff I have to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.25,0:42:26.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.80,0:42:30.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我从不让我的助手饿着肚子走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I never let my aides leave on an empty stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.05,0:42:34.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跟我一起吃饭，然后我的司机送你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll dine with me and then my driver will transport you
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.72,0:42:37.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去机场，赶22点飞波士顿的班机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to the airport for the Boston shuttle departing at 2200 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.14,0:42:42.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}趁这会儿，把我的包打开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Meanwhile, unpack my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.02,0:42:44.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要去给茅房开个光。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna christen the latrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.32,0:42:49.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你叫什么名字，司机？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's your name, driver?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.32,0:42:50.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}曼尼，长官。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Manny, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.57,0:42:55.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}曼尼。华尔道夫的行李员，找应召女郎在行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Manny. The bellhops at the Waldorf, are they any good at getting escorts?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.61,0:42:57.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道，长官。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wouldn't know, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.70,0:42:58.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你知道什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What would you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.12,0:43:00.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.00,0:43:02.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于那个，你懂的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}About you-know-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.21,0:43:06.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许我能想想办法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe I could manage something.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.92,0:43:09.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说的是最上等的货色。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm talkin' top of the line, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.46,0:43:11.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我想想，长官。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me think about this, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.85,0:43:22.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.43,0:43:23.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With me?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.81,0:43:26.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。车子感觉沉。你知道为什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Car feels heavy. You know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.44,0:43:29.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你他妈把全世界的重量都扛在肩上了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got the fuckin' weight of the world on your shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.82,0:43:35.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在学校有点小麻烦，仅此而已。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got a little problem at school, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.99,0:43:37.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说出来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Spit it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.49,0:43:38.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么大不了的，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not a big deal, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.07,0:43:40.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们去哪儿，橡树厅还是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where we going, the Oak Room or somethin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.16,0:43:43.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}既然没什么大不了，你为什么说非常重要？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If it's not a big deal, why did you say real important stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.96,0:43:47.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你干了什么，搞了院长的女儿？哈！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doin', banging the dean's daughter? Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.42,0:43:51.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是有点小麻烦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just in a little trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.38,0:43:52.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么麻烦？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What kind of trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.51,0:43:55.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看见几个家伙在干些什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw some guys doing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.88,0:44:01.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说还是不说，不然你就完蛋了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To tell or not to tell, or it's your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.31,0:44:03.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.52,0:44:06.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么知道的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How'd you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.94,0:44:09.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是巫师。告诉我细节，快。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm a wizard. Give me the details, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.74,0:44:17.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}学校有个家伙叫哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's this guy at school named Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.82,0:44:21.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是个很有钱的孩子，基本上掌握大权。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's this real rich kid, and he like, runs the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.28,0:44:23.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who else?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.04,0:44:29.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有个家伙，乔治，但乔治什么都没做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's another guy, George, but George didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.50,0:44:33.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乔治和我看见哈利和他的哥们儿在干些什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}George and I saw Harry and his buddies doin' somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.46,0:44:35.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，贝尔德学校的人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, the folks at Baird,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.59,0:44:38.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们知道你和乔治能指认出有罪的人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}they know you and George can identify the guilty parties?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.64,0:44:43.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，他们觉得我们能。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, they think we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.52,0:44:45.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乔治是你的朋友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}George is a friend of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.93,0:44:48.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不是朋友，但他还不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's not a friend, but he's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.81,0:44:49.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你信得过他？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You trust him?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.94,0:44:52.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，我想是吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.36,0:44:54.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他也有奖学金？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's on scholarship, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.90,0:44:57.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.57,0:45:00.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有乔治，有哈利，我们就有麻烦了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We got George, we got Harry, we got trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.82,0:45:03.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们有钱，你穷。你想变有钱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're rich, you're poor. You wanna get rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.70,0:45:06.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想从伯德毕业，成为像他们那样有钱的大人物。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You wanna graduate Baird, become a rich big shot like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.04,0:45:08.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我说得对吗？  -不对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Am I right?   -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.66,0:45:10.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}根本不是那么回事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not that way at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.96,0:45:12.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，查理！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, Charlie!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.34,0:45:16.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生们，到了，橡木厅。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here we are, gentlemen, the Oak Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.34,0:45:18.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}橡木厅！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Oak Room!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.47,0:45:22.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我们拿份菜单，再来双份杰克丹尼加冰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bring us a menu and double Jack Daniels on the rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.64,0:45:24.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理，坐这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie, sit down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.64,0:45:27.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生，换上这个也许会更舒服些。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Perhaps you'll feel more comfortable in this, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.31,0:45:35.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看起来棒极了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You look great!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.28,0:45:41.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.99,0:45:46.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到了，查理，橡木厅。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here we are, Charlie, the Oak Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.99,0:45:49.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，给我念念菜单。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, read me the bill of fare.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.21,0:45:51.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.17,0:45:55.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}橡木厅汉堡配薯条，24美元。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got the Oak Room burger and fries for $24.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.34,0:45:56.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}酒呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's the booze?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.09,0:45:58.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这儿上酒慢得跟泥浆流似的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Flowin'' like mud around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.76,0:46:00.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个24美元的汉堡？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A $24 hamburger?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.68,0:46:02.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's the story?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.09,0:46:04.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What story?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.01,0:46:07.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是个有钱的守财奴还是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you a rich miser or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.14,0:46:09.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.72,0:46:11.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我只是个普通的瞎子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I'm just your average blind man.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.14,0:46:13.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}普通的瞎子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your average blind man.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.94,0:46:17.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你打算怎么付这些账？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How do you plan on paying for all this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.15,0:46:20.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}崭新的钞票。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Crisp, clean dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.49,0:46:21.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}美元。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}American.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.86,0:46:23.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我攒下了我的残疾补助金。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saved up my disability checks.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.03,0:46:26.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你攒了多少？我是说，我们坐头等舱飞来，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How much did you save? I mean, we flew first class,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.12,0:46:30.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}住的是华尔道夫酒店，在24美元一个汉堡的餐厅。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we're at the Waldorf-Astoria, a $24 hamburger restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.58,0:46:32.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都是计划的一部分，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All part of a plan, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.96,0:46:34.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能跟我说说吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want to let me in on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.21,0:46:36.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我凭什么？你没兴趣。你根本不在乎！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why should I? You're not interested. You don't give a shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.13,0:46:41.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要坐拉瓜迪亚机场最后一班航班走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're leavin' on that last shuttle out of LaGuardia.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.46,0:46:43.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯？哦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm? Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.05,0:46:48.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只有15分钟，孩子。我看你赶不上了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got 15 minutes, son. I don't think you're gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.76,0:46:52.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非橡木厅楼顶备着免费直升机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unless the Oak Room keeps some complimentary helicopter on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.23,0:46:55.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，先生。不行！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, sir. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.19,0:46:58.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得待到明天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're here till tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.61,0:47:01.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说最后一班是22点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You said the last shuttle leaves at 2200 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.15,0:47:04.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是10点，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's 10:00, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.74,0:47:06.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听说是这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Last I heard, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.07,0:47:08.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在才8点半。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's only 8:30.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.12,0:47:11.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我骗你的。9点走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I lied. Leaves at 9:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.08,0:47:13.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}9点走？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It leaves at 9:00?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.54,0:47:15.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}冷静。冷静。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Calm down. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.88,0:47:20.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话，查理，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The truth is, Charlie,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.55,0:47:26.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要一条导盲犬来帮我执行计划。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need a guide dog to help me execute my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.30,0:47:28.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么计划？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.22,0:47:31.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有权知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have a right to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.72,0:47:35.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实不算什么计划，查理。算是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not really a plan, Charlie. It's sort of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.06,0:47:38.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}更像一趟旅行，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}More like a tour,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.61,0:47:41.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一次小小的享乐之旅。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a little tour of pleasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.73,0:47:45.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}住头等酒店，吃顿好饭，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stay in a first-class hotel, eat an agreeable meal,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.16,0:47:48.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喝杯好酒，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}drink a nice glass of wine,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.12,0:47:51.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看我哥哥。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}see my big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.87,0:47:54.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}家人就是不一样，你知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing like family, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.62,0:47:58.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后，跟一个绝妙的女人做爱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then, make love to a terrific woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.88,0:48:02.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}之后……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After that...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.14,0:48:09.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.97,0:48:16.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要躺到华尔道夫那张又大又漂亮的床上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna lie down on my big, beautiful bed at the Waldorf
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.60,0:48:18.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后一枪打烂自己的脑袋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and blow my brains out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.15,0:48:24.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可以为您介绍今日特餐吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}May I tell you our specials?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.19,0:48:25.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可以，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You may, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.15,0:48:30.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚有炭烤鹿肉配荞麦面疙瘩和绿胡椒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tonight we have charred venison with buckwheat spaetzle and green peppercorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.53,0:48:34.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}烤小牛肉片配番茄酱料和烤茄子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Grilled veal paillards, tomato tapenade, and roasted eggplants.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.24,0:48:36.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我拿张餐巾。我都流口水了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get me a napkin. My mouth's watering.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.25,0:48:38.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果您想要奶油舒芙蕾做甜点，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you would like our creme soufflé for dessert,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.50,0:48:40.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最好现在就点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it would be a good idea to order now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.50,0:48:44.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，舒芙蕾要了。其余的给我们半分钟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, on the soufflé. Give us a half a minute on the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.84,0:48:46.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好的，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very good, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.51,0:48:52.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我偏向面疙瘩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm leaning towards the spaetzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.51,0:48:55.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-斯莱德中校……  -查理，桌上有小面包吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Colonel Slade...   -Charlie, rolls on the table?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.02,0:48:57.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}递给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give 'em to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.23,0:48:59.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你该尝尝这些小面包，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You should try these rolls, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.48,0:49:03.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在瓦丘卡堡的时候老梦见它们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I used to dream about them when I was at Fort Huachuca.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.23,0:49:05.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-斯莱德中校……  -科罗拉多河以西的面包都不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Colonel Slade...   -Bread's no good west of the Colorado.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.94,0:49:07.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}水碱太重。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Water's too alkaline.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.78,0:49:09.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斯莱德中校，你刚才说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel Slade, did you Say...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.91,0:49:12.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没听错吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did I hear you right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.08,0:49:16.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说你要自杀？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You said you're gonna kill yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.45,0:49:17.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.91,0:49:19.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说我要一枪打烂自己的脑袋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I said I was gonna blow my brains out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.21,0:49:23.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尝尝这个小面包，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Try one of these rolls, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.29,0:49:25.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我帮你涂好黄油了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I buttered it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.80,0:49:27.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想吃小面包，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want a roll, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.34,0:49:29.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。那吃个小萝卜！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Have a radish!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.22,0:49:31.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.72,0:49:36.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！给我来杯双份杰克丹尼加冰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello! Bring me a double Jack Daniels on the rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.02,0:49:38.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好的，先生。马上来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, sir. Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.31,0:49:44.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求你了，别这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please, don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.90,0:49:47.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.24,0:49:55.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.54,0:50:00.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多奇妙的地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What a marvelous place.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.25,0:50:05.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.92,0:50:10.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.72,0:50:14.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的铺位在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your billet is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.22,0:50:18.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}壁橱架子上有被褥。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll find bedding in the closet on the shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.31,0:50:23.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}早上这里会恢复成客厅模式。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In the morning, the area will be returned to sitting-room mode
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.52,0:50:25.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不晚于早上七点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}no later than 0700 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.90,0:50:31.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.99,0:50:35.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.28,0:50:39.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下次给我利索点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Next time snap it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.46,0:50:45.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拇指贴掌心，食指贴小指，整齐对齐，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thumb to palm, index finger through little digit, smartly aligned,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.21,0:50:49.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}利落到发际线，放下！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}sharp to the hairline, down!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.26,0:50:58.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比你强得多的人都行过这个礼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Too many men, far better than you, have executed that courtesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.31,0:51:02.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要是聪明，就别再试了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And if you're smart, you won't try it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.60,0:51:11.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这根手杖的雷达比鹦鹉螺号还灵。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This bat has got sharper radar than the Nautilus.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.44,0:51:14.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别跟我耍花样，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't fuck with me, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.16,0:51:27.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚好好睡一觉，孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See you get a good night's sleep, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.76,0:51:42.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天天气真好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a lovely day today
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.47,0:51:45.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，不管你要做什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, whatever you gotta do
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.44,0:51:48.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有个好日子去做，没错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got a lovely day to do it in, that's true
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.24,0:51:57.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}早上好，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good morning, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.37,0:52:01.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}早上好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.45,0:52:03.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是索菲亚，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is Sofia, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.45,0:52:05.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是个针线魔术师。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's a magician with a needle.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.79,0:52:08.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}索菲亚正在给我做一套格伦格纹西装，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sofia's workin' me up a little Glen Plaid number,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.92,0:52:12.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我让她也给你做一套。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I've asked her if she'd put something together for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.30,0:52:14.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不需要衣服，上校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't need any clothes, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.46,0:52:17.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上流都市任务的标准配备。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Standard issue for an upscale urban assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.80,0:52:20.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要是不喜欢这衣服，查理，任务结束后，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't like the clothes, Charlie, on completion of duty,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.43,0:52:22.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可以送人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you can give 'em away.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.81,0:52:26.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那边推车上有果汁、咖啡和各种好东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Juice, coffee, and other assorted goodies on the trolley over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.44,0:52:28.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}起来，收拾利索。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get yourself up, get yourself together.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.52,0:52:32.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是个唱歌的好日子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a great day for singin' a song
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.82,0:52:36.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也是个上路的好日子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And it's a great day for movin' along
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.36,0:52:38.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从早到晚都是好日子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And it's a great day from morning to night
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.91,0:52:40.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是个好日子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And it's a great day
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.41,0:52:44.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对每个人的境遇来说都是好日子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For everybody's plight
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.46,0:52:52.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天感觉怎么样，上校？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How are you feeling today, Colonel?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.50,0:52:53.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}超级好！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.96,0:52:55.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}高人一等！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Superior!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.51,0:52:57.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多余！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Superfluous!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.42,0:53:00.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这位年轻的索菲今天感恩节还在干活\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Young Sofie here is working Thanksgiving
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.34,0:53:03.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为她想自己挣钱读完大学。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because she's trying to put herself through college.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.51,0:53:06.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我告诉她，‘我的年轻朋友查理要上大学了。’\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told her, "My young friend Charlie's headed for college."
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.68,0:53:08.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}失陪一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.44,0:53:09.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你去哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where you goin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.56,0:53:11.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得打个电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need to use the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.44,0:53:13.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这儿的电话怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's wrong with the phones in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.07,0:53:15.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想打扰你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want to disturb you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.78,0:53:18.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没打扰我。打你的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not disturbing me. Make your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.95,0:53:20.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想私下打。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd kind of like to be private.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.28,0:53:21.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别进我房间！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stay out of my room!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.08,0:53:25.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在这儿打已经够私密了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is as private as you're gonna get.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.29,0:53:32.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但如果你有非做不可的事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But if you've got somethin' that must be done
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.08,0:53:36.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且只能一个人做\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And it can only be done by one
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.38,0:53:39.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}索菲亚，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sofia,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.18,0:53:43.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么时候有机会给你也做一套？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}what are the chances of suitin' you up sometime?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.39,0:53:48.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}糖灌木山庄。请找乔治·威利斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Sugarbush Lodge.   -George Willis, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.19,0:53:52.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.52,0:53:53.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乔治！嘿，我是查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}George! Hey, it's Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.48,0:53:57.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，查斯。明年你得跟我们一起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Chas. Next year you gotta come up with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.11,0:54:01.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雪兔女郎打底，上面铺白粉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}White powder on a base of snow bunnies.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.57,0:54:04.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查斯，你在听吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chas, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.45,0:54:07.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，我在。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.33,0:54:09.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你让我有动静就打电话给你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You told me to call you for the moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.62,0:54:10.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.04,0:54:14.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}目前，按兵不动，维持现状。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For now, the move's no move, status quo.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.54,0:54:16.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一切都跟我们离开时一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everything's the way we left it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.30,0:54:17.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们离开时是什么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How did we leave it?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.50,0:54:21.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非礼勿视，非礼勿听。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See no evil, hear no evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.51,0:54:24.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你懂我意思吧，查斯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what I mean, Chas?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.05,0:54:28.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}懂。非礼勿视，非礼勿听。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. See no evil, hear no evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.31,0:54:33.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，那就说到做到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, then, walk like you talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.60,0:54:35.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，再见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.52,0:54:38.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乔治·威利斯，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}George Willis, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.53,0:54:40.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.40,0:54:42.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乔治·威利斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}George Willis.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.95,0:54:46.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那他父亲大概就是老乔治·威利斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That makes his father probably George Willis, Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.28,0:54:49.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理，我问你，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie, I ask you,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.37,0:54:53.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得老乔治会怎么看小乔治\N{\rEN\blur0.8}what do you think big George is gonna feel about little George
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.37,0:54:56.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非礼勿视、非礼勿听？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}seeing no evil, hearing no evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.80,0:55:00.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不告诉父母就行了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, we're not gonna tell our parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.22,0:55:04.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们俩自己知道就行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're just gonna keep it between ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.68,0:55:07.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，乔治才不会把这事告诉他父亲！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, George isn't gonna tell his father about this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.47,0:55:09.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他可真够意思。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn decent of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.52,0:55:13.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-打扰了，上校。  -请便。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Scusi, Colonnello.   -Prego.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.64,0:55:15.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就喜欢你弄疼我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love it when you hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.77,0:55:18.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟我说说，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell me now, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.69,0:55:22.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个小乔治·威利斯，他父亲是干什么的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This George Willis, Jr., what's his father do?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.57,0:55:25.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不太清楚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't really know.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.32,0:55:27.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我来告诉你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I'm gonna tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.49,0:55:29.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当老乔治·威利斯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When George Willis, Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.41,0:55:32.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不在做安泰意外保险公司的百万级业务员时……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}isn't busy as a million-dollar man for Aetna Casualty...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.16,0:55:35.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者说是克莱斯勒公司的新英格兰地区经销商？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or is it New England distributor for the Chrysler Corporation?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.00,0:55:39.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他就把心思放在小儿子小乔治·威利斯身上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He concerns himself with his young son, George Willis, Jr.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.88,0:55:43.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乔治不会跟他父亲说什么的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}George isn't going to say anything to his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.51,0:55:45.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.59,0:55:47.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老乔治会逼问小乔治，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Big George is gonna wind up little George,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.97,0:55:50.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小乔治就会像金丝雀一样全招了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and little George is gonna sing like a canary.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.10,0:55:53.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要是识相，小子，你也得赶紧照做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And if you're hip, kid, you're gonna hop to, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.89,0:55:56.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你都算准了，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've got this all figured out, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.19,0:56:00.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这事不用靠青年美国优秀奖学金也看得明白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It don't take no Young American merit scholarship to figure this one out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.48,0:56:02.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理，你本来日子过得好好的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie, you had a little life,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.61,0:56:07.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你决定去贝尔德学校，好让自己有机会过上大日子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so you decided to go to the Baird school to put yourself in the market for a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.45,0:56:09.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，为了继续有机会，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, in order to stay in the running,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.41,0:56:13.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就得告诉那些人他们想知道的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you're gonna have to tell these people what they want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.58,0:56:14.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这么觉得？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.04,0:56:16.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们跳完了吗，索菲亚？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are we finished, Sofia?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.21,0:56:17.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是的。  -谢谢。谢谢。去吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yes.   -Grazie. Grazie. Andate.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.30,0:56:22.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.92,0:56:26.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你现在不开口，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if you don't sing now,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.80,0:56:30.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你最后不光会去摆饼干\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you're gonna end up, not only shelving biscuits
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.39,0:56:33.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在俄勒冈郊区的某家便利店里，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in some convenience store in the Oregon 'burbs,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.47,0:56:36.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且你这辈子听到自己说的最后一句话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but probably the last word you'll ever hear yourself say
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.39,0:56:38.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在你临死前，会是——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}just before you croak, gonna be,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.73,0:56:42.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“祝你愉快，欢迎再来。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Have a nice day and come back soon."
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.61,0:56:44.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}索菲亚！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sofia!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.48,0:56:46.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给查理量尺寸，马上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Measure up Charlie, here, pronto.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.32,0:56:48.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们感恩节有约了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We got a date for Thanksgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.74,0:56:50.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们有约？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We got a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.41,0:56:52.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我哥哥家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My brother's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.37,0:56:55.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}W.R. 斯莱德，纽约州白原市。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}W.R. Slade, White Plains, New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.16,0:56:58.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校，我不能跟你去你哥哥家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel, I can't go with you to your brother's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.71,0:57:01.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，我该回学校了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I should be getting back to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.67,0:57:08.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感恩节总得有个地方过吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you gotta have Thanksgiving somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.47,0:57:10.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，有吃有喝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, eats and treats.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.72,0:57:12.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要有人陪，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can use the company, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.81,0:57:17.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.48,0:57:18.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他知道我要来吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Does he know I'm comin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.94,0:57:20.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不知道我要来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He doesn't know I'm comin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.52,0:57:23.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但等我进门时你瞧他那表情。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But wait till you see the look on his face when I walk through the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.90,0:57:25.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，他可喜欢我了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, he loves me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.69,0:57:31.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，查理，关于你那点小麻烦，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Charlie, about your little problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.78,0:57:34.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这世上有两种人：\N{\rEN\blur0.8}there are two kinds of people in this world:
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.49,0:57:38.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一种是站起来承担后果的，一种是找地方躲的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}those who stand up and face the music, and those who run for cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.75,0:57:40.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}躲起来更好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cover's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.42,0:57:42.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，索菲亚，给他打扮起来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, Sofia, suit him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.63,0:57:44.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把他弄漂亮点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Make him pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.69,0:58:02.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.56,0:58:05.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我按门铃吗？  -按吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Should I ring it?   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.28,0:58:16.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-谁啊？  -是我！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yes?   -Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.78,0:58:18.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.58,0:58:19.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是兰迪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's Randy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.16,0:58:21.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}兰迪？新来的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Randy? You new?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.04,0:58:24.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是你外甥。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm your nephew.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.67,0:58:26.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈！我来了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hah! Here I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.21,0:58:29.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你妹妹把我藏了够久了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your sister's been hoarding me long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.17,0:58:32.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该把财富分一分了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thought it's time to spread the riches around.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.59,0:58:34.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-弗兰克叔叔。  -格洛丽亚！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Uncle Frank.   -Gloria!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.84,0:58:36.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-盖尔。  -当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Gail.   -Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.72,0:58:40.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}向纽约市来的家常聚餐会问好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Say hello to the potluck party from New York City.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.68,0:58:43.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好老弗兰克叔叔，跟着他的是查理·西姆斯，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good old Uncle Frank and this here with him is Charlie Simms,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.02,0:58:46.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贝尔德橄榄球队的明星半卫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}star halfback of the Baird football team.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.90,0:58:50.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们不光打败了埃克塞特和格罗顿，连阿奎那高中也赢了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They not only beat Exeter and Groton, but Aquinas High School, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.78,0:58:53.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你那可怜的爸爸呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's your miserable father?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.70,0:58:55.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等！别，别。我们给他个惊喜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait! No, no. Let's surprise him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.87,0:58:59.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让他那颗胖心脏吓一跳。威利！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give that fat heart of his an attack. Willie!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.54,0:59:02.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，威利！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ho, Willie!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.14,0:59:17.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好，弗兰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.18,0:59:20.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你好吗？  -还行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-How you doin'?   -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.68,0:59:21.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的手在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here's my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.64,0:59:25.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理，见见 W.R. 斯莱德。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie, meet W.R. Slade.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.98,0:59:27.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很高兴认识您，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice to meet you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.44,0:59:30.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}正宗鼓鼓公文包先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The original bulging briefcase man.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.23,0:59:32.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}格雷琴，我闻到那些西梅味了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gretchen, I smell those prunes!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.03,0:59:35.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-咱们说的是马贝拉火鸡吗？  -没错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We talkin' turkey Marbella?   -Yes, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.45,0:59:39.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我闻闻。来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's have a whiff. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.12,0:59:42.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我一直对你有点意思。过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I always had a sneaker for you. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.33,0:59:48.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你在哪儿，加里？我听见你咳嗽了。就在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Where are you, Garry? I heard you cough. Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.92,0:59:50.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你又是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who are you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.67,0:59:55.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在华尔道夫酒店，跟……是你哥哥吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm here at the Waldorf with... Is it your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.47,0:59:57.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}W.R. 的最后一版。你好啊，小子？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}W.R.'s final issue. How ya doin', son?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.97,1:00:00.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，没错，弗兰克是我哥哥。你他妈是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, sure, Frank's my brother. Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.14,1:00:03.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我周末负责照顾他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm takin' care of him for the weekend.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.39,1:00:04.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.56,1:00:07.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.10,1:00:09.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}酒在哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's the booze?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.11,1:00:11.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这儿流得跟泥浆似的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Flowin'' like mud here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.52,1:00:14.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话，我觉得上校身体不太好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To tell the truth, the Colonel's not well, I don't think.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.57,1:00:16.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}身体不好？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not well?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.07,1:00:19.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得他有点孤独。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think he's a little lonely.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.74,1:00:21.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么不带他去你家吃晚饭？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why didn't you take him to your family's for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.95,1:00:23.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听见了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I heard that!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.33,1:00:26.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听见了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I heard that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.96,1:00:29.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别理他，查理。那只是哥哥的唠叨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pay no attention to him, Charlie. That's just big-brother talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.08,1:00:32.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他从第一天起就照顾我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's been watching out for me since day one.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.96,1:00:37.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}帮我摆脱的麻烦多得他都不想记。嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bailed me out of more trouble than he'd like to remember. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.97,1:00:39.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来，把外套给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here, let me take your coat.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.85,1:00:43.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我本想路上买点酒，但搞砸了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I meant to pick up some vino on my way up, but I blew it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.97,1:00:46.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}圣诞节我再给你寄罗斯柴尔德酒，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll send you the Rothschild again for Christmas,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.73,1:00:48.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就看感恩节过得怎么样了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}only let's see how Thanksgiving goes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.06,1:00:50.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我再加两个位子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll set two more places.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.69,1:00:51.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的酒，弗兰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here's your drink, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.02,1:00:53.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，谢谢你，兰迪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, thank you, Randy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.98,1:00:56.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还在雪花糖业公司？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Still with Snow Queen Sugar?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.78,1:01:00.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雪花。你怎么老说错？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Snow Flake. Why do you always get that wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.70,1:01:02.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为说对对我来说不重要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because it's not important for me to get it right.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.87,1:01:04.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你现在在那儿做什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing there now?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.95,1:01:06.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是营销副总裁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm vice president for marketing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.08,1:01:09.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呼哈！恭喜！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hoo-ah! Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.00,1:01:11.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过糖是垃圾。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sugar is shit, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.63,1:01:14.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟艾布拉姆斯将军说过，军需店该卖蜂蜜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told General Abrams, install honey in the commissaries.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.96,1:01:18.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是 K-50 没打爆你的脑袋，糖准会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If K-50s didn't blow your brains out, sugar, sure as shit, was gonna.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.01,1:01:20.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家何不坐下？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't we all sit down?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.01,1:01:21.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.10,1:01:25.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}米津纪。跟“小蜜”押韵。小心点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mitsouki. Rhymes with nookie. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.02,1:01:28.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老婆一不安分，就变得野起来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When the wife gets restless, the wife gets racy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.98,1:01:30.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，我们去吃饭吧，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, let's go and eat, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.56,1:01:31.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By all means.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.48,1:01:35.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.23,1:01:39.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想坐哪儿，弗兰克？还是坐主位？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where you wanna sit, Frank? At the head again?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.45,1:01:43.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}随便哪张牌桌都行。这儿挺好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Any old card table will do. This is fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.95,1:01:46.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说到哪儿了？哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where was I? Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.62,1:01:49.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我醒来，凌晨四点。不知道身边是谁，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, I wake up. It's 4:00 in the morning. I don't know who I'm with
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.00,1:01:52.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也不知道为什么在那儿，自己在哪儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or why I'm there, or where I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.83,1:01:55.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我怎么办？我这边是朵亚洲小花，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What am I gonna do? I got this Asian flower
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.00,1:01:59.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咯咯笑着，水灵灵的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on one hand, all giggly and dewy-like,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.42,1:02:04.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那边是个奥马哈来的硬派海军护士。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and this hard-boiled Navy nurse outta Omaha, on the other.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.60,1:02:08.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三个人横在床上，一丝不挂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're three across the bed, not a stitch of clothes on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.85,1:02:10.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我灵机一动。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It comes to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.14,1:02:15.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让东方遇见西方。我们架一座金桥。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let east meet west. We'll build a golden bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.73,1:02:20.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我感觉自己刚加入了工程兵部队！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I felt like I'd just joined the corps of engineers!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.78,1:02:28.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们都还在吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We all still here?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.29,1:02:31.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是个美妙的故事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a beautiful story.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.79,1:02:37.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你总喜欢吓唬人吗，弗兰克叔叔？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you always enjoy shocking people, Uncle Frank?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.59,1:02:38.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亲爱的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honey...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.84,1:02:41.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道你这么容易被吓到，兰迪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't know you were so easily shocked, Randy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.22,1:02:43.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我欣赏你的敏感，我很感动。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I admire your sensibilities, I'm touched.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.59,1:02:46.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸，还记得你那次劝弗兰克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dad, remember the time you persuaded Frank
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.68,1:02:48.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去犬舍吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to go to the kennel?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.89,1:02:49.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那又怎样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What about it?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.06,1:02:52.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他差点把导盲犬生意搞垮了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He almost put the seeing eye dog business outta business.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.23,1:02:53.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}冷静点，兰迪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cool it, Randy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.56,1:02:55.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都过去了，结束了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's over and done with.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.86,1:02:57.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}确实如此，加里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Indeed it is, Garry.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.86,1:02:59.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}确实如此。晚饭也是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Indeed it is. So is dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.07,1:03:01.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理，几点了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie, what time you have?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.70,1:03:02.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想我们该回去了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think we better be gettin' back.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.15,1:03:06.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你考虑过盲文手表吗，弗兰克？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You ever given any thought to a Braille watch, Frank?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.37,1:03:07.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}兰迪……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Randy...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.49,1:03:10.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}史蒂夫·旺德就戴一块，还是你也要奚落他？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stevie Wonder wears one, or do you rank on him, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.12,1:03:12.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亲爱的，拜托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honey, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.25,1:03:14.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没关系，格洛丽亚。我很享受兰迪的观察。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's all right, Gloria. I enjoy Randy's observations.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.71,1:03:16.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我妻子的名字是盖尔，弗兰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My wife's name is Gail, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.13,1:03:18.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你听见了吗？盖尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you hear that? Gail.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.96,1:03:21.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。盖尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me. Gail.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.92,1:03:24.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}盖尔给我的印象是非常美丽的女人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gail strikes me as a very beautiful woman,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.97,1:03:27.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是，你知道，她声音里有点紧张。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but, you know, there's a little tension in her voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.76,1:03:30.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道是什么。可能是两者之一，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know what it is. It could be one of two things,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.56,1:03:33.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要么盖尔是紧张，要么是不满足。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}either Gail is nervous or unsatisfied.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.31,1:03:36.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想说什么，弗兰克叔叔？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's your point, Uncle Frank?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.15,1:03:38.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你应该给她口交。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You ought to go down on her.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.65,1:03:40.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-别说了，弗兰克，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Cut it out, Frank, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.03,1:03:44.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你太沉迷于糖了，都忘了真正蜂蜜的味道！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've gotten so wrapped up in sugar, you forgotten the taste of real honey!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.16,1:03:46.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗兰克，看在上帝的份上！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Frank, for God's sake!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.78,1:03:47.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听见那声音了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hear that voice?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.99,1:03:49.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那裙子底下有火。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's fire under that dress.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.53,1:03:51.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你能不能别说了？  -赶紧滚出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Will you cut it out?   -Just get the fuck outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.79,1:03:53.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-呼哈！回你的豪车里去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hoo-ah! Get in your limousine.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.79,1:03:57.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去鲍威利吧，跟其他那些醉鬼混在一起，那才是你该待的地方！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go down to the Bowery. Get with the other fucking drunks, where you belong!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.00,1:03:59.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.17,1:04:00.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-干什么？  -你能不能消停点？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What?   -Can you take it easy?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.05,1:04:02.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}凭什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What for?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.17,1:04:05.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想让我放过他，查基，就因为他瞎了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want me to lay off him, Chucky, 'cause he's blind?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.09,1:04:07.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是，但是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.18,1:04:09.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我朋友的名字叫查尔斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My friend's name is Charles.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.22,1:04:11.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不喜欢别人叫他查基。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He doesn't like to be called Chucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.22,1:04:13.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这本来该是家庭聚会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is supposed to be a family get-together.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.81,1:04:15.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是个警告。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just a warning.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.18,1:04:18.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，又一个傻瓜以为这混蛋是战争英雄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jesus Christ, another sucker who thinks this shit-heel's a war hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.10,1:04:20.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呼哈！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hoo-ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.61,1:04:25.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许，曾经是吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, once, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.36,1:04:29.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我猜他跟你讲过他在林登·约翰逊幕僚班子的日子？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I suppose he told you about his days on Lyndon Johnson's staff?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.87,1:04:32.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我本来要走。现在我不走了。哈！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was gonna go. Now I'm not leaving. Hah!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.12,1:04:35.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗兰克本来内定要当将军的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Frank was earmarked for general.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.62,1:04:37.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}内定，好词。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Earmarked, good word.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.79,1:04:40.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗兰克就喜欢往每个人眼睛里吐口水！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Frank likes to spit in everybody's eye!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.17,1:04:41.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}兰迪，够了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Randy, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.34,1:04:45.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那他们，在军队里给人使绊子叫什么来着？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So they, what do they call it, when they give you the shaft in the military?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.88,1:04:47.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没升上去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Passed over!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.22,1:04:50.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，弗兰克晋升被跳过了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right, Frank was passed over for promotion.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.89,1:04:52.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好几次。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Couple times.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.39,1:04:57.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想知道后来怎么样了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You wanna know what happened then?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.73,1:04:59.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能不能闭嘴？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you shut your mouth?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.19,1:05:00.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他把自己炸了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He blew himself up.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.69,1:05:02.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}住口，兰迪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop it, Randy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.23,1:05:05.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们这位上校有个耍手榴弹的节目，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Our Colonel here had a grenade juggling act
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.36,1:05:07.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在布拉格堡，或者他们把他扔到的随便什么地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}at Fort Bragg, or wherever it was they dumped him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.99,1:05:08.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}本宁堡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fort Benning.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.11,1:05:11.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在给少尉们教格斗……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was teaching hand-to-hand combat to second lieutenants...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.99,1:05:14.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}兰迪，跟我说话的时候看着我，孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Randy, look at me when you're talking to me, now, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.45,1:05:18.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看着呢，弗兰克。他那个节目的搭档是个上尉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm lookin', Frank. His partner in the act was some captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.87,1:05:20.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}文森特·斯夸尔斯少校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Major Vincent Squires.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.38,1:05:21.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}管他是谁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoever he was.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.67,1:05:24.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上场之前，他们先吃低卡早餐，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Before going on, they'd have a lo-cal breakfast,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.42,1:05:27.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗兰克喝螺丝起子，他搭档喝血腥玛丽。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a screwdriver for Frank, bloody mary for his partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.26,1:05:29.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不对，文森特喝海风。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, Vincent drank Sea Breezes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.26,1:05:34.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}本宁堡的军法官说斯莱德上校喝了四杯，他搭档才一杯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Judge Advocate at Benning said Colonel Slade had four to his partner's one.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.30,1:05:38.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他真是飞得高级。他一兴奋起来，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's really flying in class. He gets all excited.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.18,1:05:40.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就开始拔保险销。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He starts pulling the pins out.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.86,1:05:45.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一颗手榴弹从他手里滑了出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One grenade got away from him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.36,1:05:46.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}轰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Boom.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.28,1:05:51.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是溜掉的那颗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The one that got away.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.28,1:05:53.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗兰克声称保险销还插着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The pin was in, Frank claims.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.70,1:05:57.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}插着还是拔了，有什么区别？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In or out, what difference does it make?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.50,1:06:00.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么样的他妈疯子会耍手榴弹？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What kind of fucking lunatic juggles grenades?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.12,1:06:02.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}文尼没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Vinnie came out okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.38,1:06:04.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗兰克只失去了视力。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All Frank lost was his eyesight.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.05,1:06:10.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想知道实话吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You wanna know the truth?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.30,1:06:11.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这你受得了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got a handle on that, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.88,1:06:13.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他以前就是个混蛋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was an asshole before.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.30,1:06:14.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呼哈！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hoo-ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.18,1:06:18.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在他只是个瞎眼混蛋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now all he is, is a blind asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.93,1:06:20.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呼哈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hoo-ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.32,1:06:29.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，上帝真会开玩笑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, God's a funny guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.24,1:06:33.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上帝确实有幽默感。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God doth have a sense of humor.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.24,1:06:39.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许上帝觉得有些人不配看见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe God thinks some people don't deserve to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.75,1:06:42.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呼哈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hoo-ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.46,1:06:48.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你听懂了吗，查基？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You get the point, Chucky?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.97,1:06:55.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他叫查尔斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His name is Charles.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.22,1:06:58.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会叫吧？查尔斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can say that, can't you? Charles.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.47,1:07:00.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道这是什么吗，兰迪？这是游骑兵锁喉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Know what this is, Randy? It's a Ranger choke hold.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.14,1:07:03.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-教那些中尉时学的。  -上校，松手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-From teaching those lieutenants.   -Colonel, let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.44,1:07:05.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再加点力，我就掐碎你气管。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Little pressure, I bust your windpipe.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.02,1:07:07.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不管他对我说了什么。-跟我来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I don't care what he said to me.   -After me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.82,1:07:08.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查尔斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charles.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.07,1:07:10.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快松手，求你了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just let go, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.34,1:07:31.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}格雷琴？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gretchen?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.30,1:07:35.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你做得太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You outdid yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.26,1:07:41.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要真使劲逼我，明年我们就去马贝拉吃火鸡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you twist my arm hard enough, we're talking turkey Marbella next year.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.35,1:07:43.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁知道呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.36,1:07:51.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗兰克？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Frank?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.82,1:07:54.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见，威利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goodbye, Willie.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.32,1:08:01.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我他妈就是个废物。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm no fucking good.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.33,1:08:05.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直都是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I never have been.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.34,1:08:13.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧，查理，去拿外套。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, Charlie, get the coats.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.14,1:08:22.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校，小心脚下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel. Watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.23,1:08:26.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.37,1:08:44.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}纽约，老兄。走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nueva York, compadre. Vamos!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.12,1:09:30.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有表吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got a watch?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.38,1:09:35.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在7点20。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's 7:20.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.96,1:09:40.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没问时间，我问你有没有表。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't ask you the time. I asked if you had a watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.09,1:09:42.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有，在另一间屋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, in the other room.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.60,1:09:43.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去拿来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.23,1:09:51.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校，你床边就有个钟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel, there's a clock right next to your bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.44,1:09:54.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有秒针吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Does it have a second hand?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.78,1:10:02.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-有。  -给我计时！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah.   -Time me!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.48,1:10:31.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多久？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How long?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.52,1:10:37.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大约30秒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}About 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.65,1:10:39.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我手生了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm rusty.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.15,1:10:41.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你从哪儿弄来的枪，上校？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where did you get a gun, Colonel?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.99,1:10:44.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}叫手枪或武器，查理，永远别说枪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Piece or weapon, Charlie, never gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.49,1:10:49.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你从哪儿弄来的手枪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where did you get the piece?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.16,1:10:52.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是美国陆军军官。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm an officer in the US Army.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.62,1:10:54.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我的配枪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is my sidearm.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.46,1:10:57.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可你不再是军官了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But you're not an officer anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.34,1:10:59.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我退休了，又怎样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So I'm retired, so what?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.50,1:11:02.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}军官永不交出他的点45手枪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}An officer never relinquishes his.45.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.05,1:11:06.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你最好把它交给我，不然我就得给罗西太太打电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You better relinquish it to me or I'm gonna have to call Mrs. Rossi.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.80,1:11:08.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好主意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.60,1:11:11.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我就回学校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then I'm going back to school.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.60,1:11:14.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那更好。晴空万里，一路绿灯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Even better. Blue skies, green lights.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.31,1:11:15.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}祝你旅途愉快。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hope you have a wonderful trip.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.06,1:11:19.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感觉像25秒。点45手枪得能在25秒内完成。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That felt like 25. Gotta be able to do a.45 in 25.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.36,1:11:20.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你给我计时了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you time me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.61,1:11:22.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，而且我要打给奥尔巴尼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I did not and I'm calling Albany.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.46,1:11:33.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那太蠢了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.37,1:11:36.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.42,1:11:40.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你甩不掉我了，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're stuck with me, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.21,1:11:43.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我甩得掉。我走了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I'm not. I'm outta here!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.47,1:11:44.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要去哪儿，新罕布什尔？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where you going, New Hampshire?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.05,1:11:47.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没钱。你怎么走？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got no money. How you gonna do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.56,1:11:50.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.64,1:11:54.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卡伦的号码尝起来像奥尔巴尼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Karen's number tastes like Albany.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.44,1:11:56.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hah!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.31,1:11:58.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行。我走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine. I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.94,1:12:01.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理。查理！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie. Charlie!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.96,1:12:17.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只想你再陪我一天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All I want from you is another day.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.25,1:12:20.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For what?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.13,1:12:26.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最后一次巡视战场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One last tour of the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.76,1:12:32.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像纽约这样的城市我能摸清，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can get around a city like New York,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.47,1:12:35.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.39,1:12:38.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有时候需要有人指个正确的方向。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}sometimes need a point in the right direction.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.52,1:12:43.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说呢，查尔斯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you say, Charles?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.44,1:12:46.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}朋友之间多一天算什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's one day between friends?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.53,1:12:53.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。就算我再留一天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. Say I stay for another day.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.58,1:12:56.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会把武器交给我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you give me your weapon?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.37,1:12:57.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，查理，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Charlie,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.71,1:12:59.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是美国陆军中校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm a lieutenant colonel, United States Army.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.00,1:13:02.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我他妈不会把枪交给任何人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not giving my fucking gun to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.71,1:13:04.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，你喝什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, what are you drinkin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.09,1:13:07.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校，这不可接受。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel, this is unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.63,1:13:10.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不可接受？你跟我扯什么预科学校的废话？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unacceptable? What are you givin' me that prep school crap for?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.72,1:13:11.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不可接受？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unacceptable?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.10,1:13:15.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们干了什么，把这男孩身上的俄勒冈劲儿都抽走了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What have they done, taken the Oregon out of the boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.73,1:13:18.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}塞进哈佛商学院了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put in Harvard Business School?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.02,1:13:20.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就把子弹给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then give me your bullets.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.82,1:13:30.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你明白这道理吧，查理，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You do see the sense of it, Charlie, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.03,1:13:35.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我再也嚼不动皮革了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't chew the leather anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.45,1:13:40.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我为什么还要分部落的给养？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, why should I share the tribe's provisions?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.54,1:13:45.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，再也没人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, there's no one
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.96,1:13:48.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}愿意跟我一起撕鲱鱼了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}wants to tear a herring with me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.51,1:13:52.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}子弹，上校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The bullets, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.18,1:13:54.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“子弹，上校。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"The bullets, Colonel."
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.80,1:13:58.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你听起来像《孟加拉枪骑兵》里的家伙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You sound like a guy in Lives of a Bengal Lancer.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.29,1:14:19.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你他妈操这份心干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you give a shit for?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.71,1:14:23.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}About what?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.25,1:14:27.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于我要不要崩了自己的脑袋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}About whether I blow my brains out or not.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.22,1:14:34.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我有良知。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because I have a conscience.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.10,1:14:36.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有良知。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have a conscience.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.93,1:14:39.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我忘了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.73,1:14:42.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理良知。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Charlie Conscience.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.73,1:14:47.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告不告发？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do we tell? Do we not tell?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.78,1:14:51.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}遵不遵守那富家子弟的规矩？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do we follow the rich boy's code or not?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.74,1:14:54.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要不要任由这个瞎眼混蛋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do we let this blind asshole
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.70,1:14:57.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去死？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}die or not?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.37,1:14:59.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.08,1:15:01.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}良知啊，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Conscience, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.08,1:15:04.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你哪年生的，孩子？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When were you born, son?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.04,1:15:07.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}圆桌骑士那年代？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Around the time of the Round Table?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.75,1:15:10.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没听说吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Haven't you heard?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.76,1:15:13.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}良知已经死了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Conscience is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.76,1:15:16.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我没听说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I haven't heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.51,1:15:20.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就把你耳朵里的蜡掏出来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then take the fucking wax outta your ears!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.14,1:15:24.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}成熟点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Grow up!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.70,1:15:37.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这年头就是操你哥们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's fuck your buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.78,1:15:40.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}背着老婆偷腥。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cheat on your wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.79,1:15:46.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}母亲节给妈打个电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Call your mother on Mother's Day.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.59,1:15:49.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.88,1:15:52.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全是狗屁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it's all shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.44,1:16:05.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你去哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where you goin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.81,1:16:08.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要撒泡尿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got piss call.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.23,1:16:13.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道我说过只需要你一天\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know I said I need ya for just one day
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.44,1:16:15.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可连我也憋不了那么久。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but even I can't hold it that long.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.36,1:16:19.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，还有，查理，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, and Charlie,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.41,1:16:23.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你忘了枪膛里那颗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you forgot the one in the chamber.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.79,1:16:29.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hah!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.88,1:16:33.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给您，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There you go, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.13,1:16:35.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.51,1:16:40.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}服役二十六年，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Twenty-six years in the service,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.47,1:16:43.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从没让勤务兵给我擦过鞋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}never let an aide shine my shoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.43,1:16:47.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}二十六年后你会在哪儿，查理？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where you gonna be in 26 years, Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.85,1:16:51.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我打赌正跟贝尔德学校的朋友打高尔夫吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Playing golf with your friends from the Baird School, I bet.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.65,1:16:56.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我根本不喜欢那帮人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't even like those guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.95,1:16:59.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你当然不喜欢。他们都是混蛋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course you don't. They're all assholes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.95,1:17:03.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告发他们肯定很痛快，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Be a pleasure to squeal on 'em, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.54,1:17:06.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，可我可不是告密的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, well, I'm not a squealer.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.33,1:17:07.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“我可不是告密的人。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"I'm not a squealer."
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.96,1:17:09.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这算什么，德雷福斯案吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is this, the Dreyfus case?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.55,1:17:16.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喔。喔，美人！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ooh. Ooh, mama!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.26,1:17:18.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.72,1:17:21.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.64,1:17:24.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小心脚下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.73,1:17:29.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我又感觉到那股沉重劲了，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gettin' that heavy feelin' again, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.06,1:17:35.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这事还有别的，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's more to this, isn't there?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.65,1:17:38.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Isn't there?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.41,1:17:43.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人贿赂我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was offered a bribe.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.91,1:17:45.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这下有意思了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now we're cookin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.91,1:17:49.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}特拉斯克先生，就是校长，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Trask, the headmaster,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.58,1:17:53.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他答应让我进哈佛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}he promised to get me into Harvard.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.54,1:17:54.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要你告发。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you squeal.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.71,1:17:56.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.92,1:17:58.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是两难啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What a dilemma.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.80,1:18:02.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理·西姆斯该不该接受免费进哈佛的机会？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Should Charlie Simms accept a free ride into Harvard, or not?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.72,1:18:08.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得你朋友乔治要是处在你的位置会怎么做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you think your friend George would do if he were in your shoes?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.81,1:18:09.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他差不多就是了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He is, practically.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.14,1:18:11.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么说？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.73,1:18:15.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是特拉斯克先生没答应让他进哈佛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just that Mr. Trask hasn't promised to get him into Harvard.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.02,1:18:17.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}特拉斯克先生不必。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Trask doesn't have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.94,1:18:20.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乔治的父亲会搞定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}George's father's gonna take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.11,1:18:24.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}做这笔交易吧，查理。接受吧！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do the deal, Charlie. Take it!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.99,1:18:26.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去哈佛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go to Harvard.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.49,1:18:28.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能那么做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.00,1:18:29.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么不能？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.33,1:18:35.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有些事就是不能做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There are just some things you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.96,1:18:37.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}解释给我听。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Explain 'em to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.30,1:18:40.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请大声点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Louder, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.80,1:18:41.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.14,1:18:47.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在这世上会过得很艰难，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're gonna have a tough time in this world, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.77,1:18:52.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了缓解打击，我请你喝一杯。来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To ease the blow, let me buy you a drink. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.81,1:18:55.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}双份杰克丹尼，加冰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Double Jack Daniels on the rocks.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.11,1:18:59.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我这位年轻朋友来杯秀兰·邓波儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And bring my young friend here a Shirley Temple.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.98,1:19:02.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。有啤酒吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold on. Do you have beer?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.49,1:19:04.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然有。能看下身份证吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Certainly. May I see some ID?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.07,1:19:08.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小子，你还想后半辈子能走路吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you interested in walkin' the rest of your life, chappy?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.33,1:19:09.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，先生，但是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry, sir, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.62,1:19:12.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是这儿的常客。我儿子都快23了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm a regular here. My boy's going on 23.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.00,1:19:15.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你何不打到前台，办公室？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't you call up front, the office?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.00,1:19:18.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吉尔伯特先生，他是我朋友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Gilbert, he's a friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.01,1:19:22.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要什么啤酒？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Any particular beer?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.92,1:19:25.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}施利茨。没有施利茨？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Schlitz. No Schlitz?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.01,1:19:28.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}布拉茨。没有布拉茨？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Blatz. No Blatz?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.52,1:19:30.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看着办吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Improvise.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.02,1:19:33.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我尽力，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll do my best, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.52,1:19:35.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.98,1:19:38.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也是凡人，查理。啤酒？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're human, Charlie. Beer?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.24,1:19:44.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们跟谁一起喝？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who are we drinking with?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.45,1:19:48.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我闻到那边一股好闻的香皂清水味。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm getting a nice soap-and-water feeling from down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.04,1:19:58.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是个女人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A female.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.21,1:19:59.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“女人”？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Female"?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.34,1:20:04.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你叫她“女人”肯定是喜欢她，不然你不会这么随口。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You callin' her female must mean you like her or you wouldn't be so casual.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.68,1:20:08.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她一个人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is she alone?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.14,1:20:10.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，她一个人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, she's alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.47,1:20:14.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}气氛热起来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Things are heatin' up.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.77,1:20:16.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}栗色头发？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chestnut hair?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.60,1:20:19.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}棕色，浅棕色。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Brown, light brown.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.23,1:20:22.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}二十二岁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Twenty-two?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.07,1:20:27.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么，我是游乐场里猜年龄的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What am I, a guy at a carnival?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.07,1:20:30.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理，我们不再寻找的那天，就是死的那天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The day we stop lookin', Charlie, is the day we die.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.95,1:20:33.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Move.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.24,1:20:35.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—去哪儿？  -—你知道去哪儿，孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Where?   -You know where, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.29,1:20:37.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别装傻，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't be coy, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.17,1:20:42.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这女人天生就是配你的。我能感觉到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This woman is made for you. I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.67,1:20:44.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真他妈漂亮，不是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goddamn beautiful, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.09,1:20:48.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—还不错。  -—中了！这小子还活着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-She's not bad.   -Bingo! The boy's alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.09,1:20:52.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，孩子，迈步走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, son, perambulate.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.10,1:20:54.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}迈步走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Perambulate.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.11,1:21:07.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打扰一下，小姐，介意我们坐这儿吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me, senorita, do you mind if we join you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.49,1:21:12.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得你被冷落了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm feelin' you're being neglected.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.12,1:21:15.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在等人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm expecting somebody.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.12,1:21:18.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马上就到？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Instantly?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.83,1:21:21.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，但随时会来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, but any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.79,1:21:23.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}随时？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Any minute?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.17,1:21:25.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有些人一分钟就过完了一辈子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Some people live a lifetime in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.05,1:21:29.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你现在在做什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doin' right now?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.30,1:21:31.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在等他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm waiting for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.14,1:21:34.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}介意我们陪你一起等吗，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Would you mind if we waited with you,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.97,1:21:38.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就当帮你挡住那些色鬼？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}just to keep the womanizers from bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.69,1:21:44.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我不介意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.73,1:21:46.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.70,1:21:50.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.49,1:21:57.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，我闻到空气里有股香味。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I detect a fragrance in the air.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.00,1:21:59.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别告诉我是什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't tell me what it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.92,1:22:02.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奥格维姐妹香皂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ogilvie Sisters soap.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.71,1:22:06.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太神奇了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.26,1:22:08.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是干神奇这一行的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm in the amazing business.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.42,1:22:10.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}确实是奥格维姐妹香皂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is Ogilvie Sisters soap.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.18,1:22:13.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我奶奶圣诞节送了我三块。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My grandmother gave me three bars for Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.34,1:22:15.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！我爱死你奶奶了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh! I'm crazy about your grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.64,1:22:18.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得她也会喜欢查理的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think she'd have liked Charlie, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.73,1:22:20.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别理他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't pay any attention to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.48,1:22:21.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你叫什么名字？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.10,1:22:23.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}唐娜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Donna.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.27,1:22:26.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}唐娜？我是弗兰克。这位是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Donna? I'm Frank. This here is...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.40,1:22:27.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.82,1:22:29.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。她喜欢你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. She likes you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.65,1:22:32.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理这个周末过得很不顺。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie's having a difficult weekend.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.74,1:22:34.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他正处在危机中。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's going through a crisis.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.28,1:22:37.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他看起来撑得住吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How does he look like he's holding up?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.29,1:22:39.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看他挺好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He looks fine to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.20,1:22:41.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！她真的喜欢你，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh! She does like you, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.13,1:22:48.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，唐娜，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, Donna,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.22,1:22:52.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会跳探戈吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}do you tango?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.38,1:22:56.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不会。我以前想学，可是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. I wanted to learn once, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.64,1:22:57.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.35,1:23:01.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是迈克尔不想学。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But Michael didn't want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.31,1:23:02.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}迈克尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Michael.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.81,1:23:05.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是你等的那个人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The one you're waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.11,1:23:08.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}迈克尔觉得探戈很可笑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Michael thinks the tango's hysterical.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.11,1:23:11.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得迈克尔才可笑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think Michael's hysterical.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.94,1:23:13.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别理他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't pay any attention to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.86,1:23:14.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是不是已经说过这话了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did I already say that?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.95,1:23:19.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}笑得真好听。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What a beautiful laugh.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.37,1:23:23.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢，弗兰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.80,1:23:31.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想学探戈吗，唐娜？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Would you like to learn to tango, Donna?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.26,1:23:35.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right now?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.14,1:23:40.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我免费为你效劳。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm offering you my services, free of charge.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.81,1:23:42.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.73,1:23:47.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我怕是有点不敢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think I'd be a little afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.19,1:23:50.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怕什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of what?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.28,1:23:53.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怕跳错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Afraid of making a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.99,1:23:58.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}探戈里没有错，唐娜。不像生活。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No mistakes in the tango, Donna. Not like life.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.78,1:24:01.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很简单。这正是探戈了不起的地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's simple. That's what makes the tango so great.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.62,1:24:05.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就算跳错了、乱成一团，接着跳下去就行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you make a mistake, get all tangled up, just tango on.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.29,1:24:10.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么不试试？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't you try?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.30,1:24:16.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你愿意试试吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you try it?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.97,1:24:20.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。我试试。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. I'll give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.31,1:24:23.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}扶住我，孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold me down, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.56,1:24:30.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的手臂？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your arm?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.99,1:24:35.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.53,1:24:39.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}孩子，我需要点方位信息。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna need some coordinates here, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.41,1:24:42.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}舞池大概二十乘三十英尺，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The floor's about 20 by 30,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.41,1:24:44.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在长的那一头。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you're at the long end.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.33,1:24:49.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外圈有些桌子，乐队在右边。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's some tables on the outside and the band's on the right.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.49,1:27:33.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，弗兰克，你跳得太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Frank, you are one incredible dancer.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.21,1:27:38.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等你看到查理跳舞再说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait'll you see Charlie dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.09,1:27:41.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他胡说。我不会跳舞。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's a liar. I don't dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.21,1:27:42.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是不是很会哄人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Isn't he a charmer, though?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.63,1:27:46.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话，他不但会跳舞，还能给你唱一首好歌。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Truth is, not only can he dance, but he'll sing you a hell of a tune.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.72,1:27:49.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他会学鸟叫，还会模仿贝拉·卢戈西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He can do bird calls and imitate Bela Lugosi.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.60,1:27:50.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，亲爱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.60,1:27:51.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—嗨。  -—嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hi.   -Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.31,1:27:54.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}迈克尔，这是弗兰克，这是查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Michael, this is Frank and this is Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.10,1:27:57.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们好，弗兰克、查理。抱歉我来晚了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, Frank, Charlie. Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.40,1:27:58.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，没关系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.11,1:28:01.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这两位先生陪着我，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These two gentlemen entertained me,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.69,1:28:03.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}时间过得飞快。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and time flew.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.53,1:28:06.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你女朋友探戈跳得真棒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your girl is a hell of a tango dancer.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.57,1:28:09.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你终于找到人陪你跳探戈了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At last, you found someone to tango with.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.78,1:28:11.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太棒了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's terrific!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.33,1:28:12.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我握握你的手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me shake your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.87,1:28:14.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，是弗兰克跳的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, it was Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.66,1:28:16.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我跟你们俩都握手！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hell, I'll shake both your hands!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.96,1:28:20.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这地方看着不错，但我们得走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This looks like the place, but we gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.09,1:28:24.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们跟达里尔和卡罗尔在格林威治村约好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We got a date with Darryl and Carol in the Village.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.84,1:28:27.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—你有钱结账吗？  -—迈克尔，拜托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Do you have a check?   -Michael, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.43,1:28:28.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乐意效劳。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.05,1:28:30.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不不，我来付。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no, no. I got this.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.43,1:28:32.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}迈克尔，把手从口袋里拿出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Michael, get your hand outta your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.31,1:28:33.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来吧。真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll take it. Really.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.56,1:28:35.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Allow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.44,1:28:39.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎呀，谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.94,1:28:41.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见，各位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bye, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.86,1:28:42.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.20,1:28:54.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达里尔和卡罗尔。没错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darryl and Carol. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.88,1:29:04.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是17E公寓，上校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's apartment 17E, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.80,1:29:06.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她在等你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.59,1:29:10.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心。她可是精英中的精英。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry about a thing. She's the creme de la creme.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.51,1:29:12.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我哥们带德国副总理去过她那儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My buddy took the Vice Chancellor of Germany to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.97,1:29:15.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在他都想移民来这个国家了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now he wants to immigrate to this country.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.56,1:29:17.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得好，老兄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You did good, hombre.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.77,1:29:21.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的头发怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My hair, how is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.69,1:29:24.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}完美。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.61,1:29:29.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}红丝巾我搭对了吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got the red foulard okay, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.16,1:29:31.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，深红色。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, real dark red.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.87,1:29:34.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}酒红色，查理。酒红色。她们就爱这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Burgundy, Charlie. Burgundy. They love it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.37,1:29:38.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}月桂朗姆香水。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bay rum.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.75,1:29:42.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}温莎结。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Windsor knot.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.17,1:29:47.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我感觉到的，是我的心跳。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's my heart I'm feelin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.27,1:29:58.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.79,1:30:18.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这电话能打长途吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you get long distance on this?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.50,1:30:20.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。随便打。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And how. Be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.34,1:30:32.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}舒格布什旅馆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sugarbush Lodge.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.76,1:30:34.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好，请找乔治·威利斯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. George Willis, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.43,1:30:36.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请稍等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One moment, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.68,1:30:39.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂？——哈利？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hello?   -Harry?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.85,1:30:41.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理，你好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chas, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.14,1:30:45.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你来得正好。我们正要赶紧送乔治去机场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just caught us. We're about to shoot George over to the airport.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.48,1:30:47.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乔治为什么要去机场？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why is George going to the airport?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.28,1:30:51.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。也许你该亲自跟他说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold on. Maybe you should talk to the man himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.70,1:30:53.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chas.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.86,1:30:54.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。嗨，乔治。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Hi, George.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.03,1:30:56.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你来得正好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just caught me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.49,1:30:58.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利也这么说。你去哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's what Harry said. Where you goin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.12,1:31:00.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Home.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.50,1:31:01.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回波士顿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To Boston?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.79,1:31:04.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赶一班短途小飞机。祈祷顺利吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Catching the puddle-jumper. Keep your fingers crossed.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.63,1:31:06.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你回家干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you going home for?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.71,1:31:13.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在想。特拉斯克那个混蛋？他完全没道理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was thinking. This asshole, Trask? He's making no sense at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.84,1:31:18.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总得有人去跟他说。我爸是59届的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Somebody's gotta talk to him. My father was class of '59.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.81,1:31:22.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你爸？我以为我们说好不把父母扯进来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your father? I thought we were gonna keep our parents outta this.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.73,1:31:25.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}特拉斯克这家伙失控了，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This guy Trask is out of control, Chas.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.11,1:31:29.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}失控了！总得有人去跟他说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Out of control! Somebody's gotta talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.28,1:31:31.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爸是重要的筹款人，你知道的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My father's a major fundraiser, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.11,1:31:33.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.36,1:31:34.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.57,1:31:36.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放松。他会帮我们脱身的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Relax. He'll get us off the hook.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.95,1:31:38.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得走了。一切还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I gotta go. Everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.83,1:31:39.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.16,1:31:42.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}周一见。再见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll see you Monday. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.62,1:31:43.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.40,1:32:10.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—晚安，先生。  -—晚安。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Good night, sir.   -Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.79,1:32:23.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hiya, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.08,1:32:27.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看着门口。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Watch the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.23,1:32:48.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多美的女人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What a beautiful woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.41,1:33:04.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, there.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.33,1:33:06.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看到我看到的了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you see what I see?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.29,1:33:08.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。要么是出了什么问题，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Either there's something wrong,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.04,1:33:11.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要么是我们宿醉得太厉害了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or we got the world's worst hangover.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.54,1:33:13.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请进吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Won't you come in?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.71,1:33:15.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们听说你有银行抢劫案的照片。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We hear you got a picture of the bank robbery.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.90,1:33:35.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.75,1:33:51.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校，你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel, you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.29,1:33:54.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.09,1:33:59.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}已经过中午了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's after noon.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.38,1:34:02.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你睡了一上午。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've been sleeping all morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.85,1:34:05.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那又怎样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So what?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.72,1:34:09.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。我以为……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. I thought...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.40,1:34:16.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我昨晚跟乔治谈过了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I talked to George last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.82,1:34:22.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他父亲是学校的大人物校友。很有影响力。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His father's a big-deal alumnus at school. He's got a lot of pull.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.37,1:34:25.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.12,1:34:31.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，他要去跟校长谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, he's gonna talk to the headmaster.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.46,1:34:36.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乔治觉得他也许能帮我们脱身。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}George thinks he might be able to get us off the hook.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.80,1:34:38.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“帮我们脱身。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Get us off the hook."
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.30,1:34:41.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，他是这么说的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, that's what he said.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.05,1:34:44.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}注意“我们”那部分。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Watch the "us" part.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.10,1:34:51.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校，你不想起来做点什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel, don't you wanna get up and do something?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.56,1:34:56.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.78,1:34:59.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，查理，你想干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Charlie, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.32,1:35:02.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.03,1:35:04.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你让我很紧张。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but you're making me nervous.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.95,1:35:10.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的钱包在梳妆台上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My wallet is on the dresser.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.87,1:35:13.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿出你的机票\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take out your plane ticket
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.79,1:35:18.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有400块退伍费，外加\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and $400 mustering-out pay, plus
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.59,1:35:23.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}机场到学校的出租车费。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}airport-to-school taxi.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.93,1:35:29.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校，不急。我是说，我可以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel, it's no rush. I mean, I can...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.60,1:35:31.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可以再待一阵子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I could stay for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.14,1:35:34.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理，你已经陪了我一天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie, you already gave me a day.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.94,1:35:38.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那一天，我感激不尽。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And for that day, I am eternally grateful.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.74,1:35:45.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但现在我还有别的计划。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But right now I have other plans.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.12,1:35:49.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还有什么别的计划？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What other plans do you have?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.50,1:35:53.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去死，孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To die, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.00,1:35:56.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校，你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel, you're...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.34,1:36:00.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别这样，上校，你今天不会死的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, Colonel, you're not gonna die today.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.00,1:36:03.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理，把手给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie, give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.93,1:36:09.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你现在走吧，孩子。好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You go now, boy. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.27,1:36:14.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你走吧。就……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You go. Just...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.02,1:36:20.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就让我在这儿睡吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just leave me sleep here.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.53,1:36:24.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着……我们能不能重新开始？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look... Can we start over, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.82,1:36:28.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你今天想干点什么，嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you feel like doin' today, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.99,1:36:31.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看，太阳都出来了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at this. The sun is shining!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.45,1:36:33.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天气这么好，我们……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a beautiful day. Let's...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.83,1:36:40.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校，我知道你不想扫兴，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel, I know you don't want to be a party poop,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.13,1:36:42.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我们出去做点什么吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so let's go out and do something.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.96,1:36:44.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们出去兜兜风。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go for a ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.05,1:36:51.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，兜风。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, a ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.06,1:36:55.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}兜风？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A ride?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.02,1:36:59.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，斯莱德上校，怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, Colonel Slade, what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.48,1:37:01.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们去兜风，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go for a ride, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.12,1:37:10.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}兜什么风？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What kind of ride?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.08,1:37:15.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错，这是有效的俄勒冈州驾照，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, this is a valid Oregon driver's license,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.12,1:37:19.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们允许符合条件的客户试驾特斯塔罗萨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and we let appropriate customers test-drive the Testarossa.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.88,1:37:23.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可你才17岁，还带个盲人。这可不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But you're 17, with a blind companion. That we don't do.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.84,1:37:26.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可是价值19万美元的机器。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is a $190,000 piece of machinery.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.17,1:37:28.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会让它开出这个门。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not letting it out this door.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.51,1:37:30.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这边这辆怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How about this one over here?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.18,1:37:32.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是敞篷T型，一样的规定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's a Cabriolet T. The same deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.76,1:37:37.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得我会让一个没人陪的小孩开11万美元的车？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think I'll let an unaccompanied kid get in a $110,000 car?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.18,1:37:39.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不会没人陪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He will not be unaccompanied.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.10,1:37:42.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我陪着他。我是他父亲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be with him. I'm his father.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.61,1:37:45.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是他父亲？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're his father?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.19,1:37:46.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.90,1:37:49.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有个主意。不如我带你父亲去试驾？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have an idea. Why don't I take your father for a test drive?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.07,1:37:51.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗雷迪，你的销售定额是多少？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's your quota, Freddie?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.03,1:37:53.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别操心我的定额。我业绩很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry about my quota. I do well.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.04,1:37:55.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这个月卖了几辆法拉利？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How many Ferraris you sold this month?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.08,1:37:57.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这跟现在的事没关系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's not relevant to this discussion.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.91,1:38:00.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗雷迪，80年代已经过去了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Freddie, the '80s are over.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.79,1:38:03.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是想告诉我这些车自己就能卖出去？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you tryin' to tell me these things are walkin' outta the store?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.67,1:38:07.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生，这是法拉利，汽车工业制造的最精良的机器。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is a Ferrari, sir, the finest machinery made in the automobile industry.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.92,1:38:11.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}既然你这么喜欢它，怎么不跟它睡？为什么要卖掉它？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you like it that much, why don't you sleep with it? Why are you sellin' it?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.22,1:38:12.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很乐意成全您……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd love to accommodate you...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.72,1:38:15.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果这车表现如我所料，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If this car performs the way I expect it to,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.85,1:38:19.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会收到一张101,000美元的支票，还有零头，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you will get a check of $101,000, and change,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.48,1:38:21.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明天早上你来这儿的时候。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when you come in here tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.60,1:38:25.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是109,000美元，加950美元，再加税。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's $109,000, plus $950, plus tax.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.61,1:38:28.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗雷迪，给你个价\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Freddie, for you
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.36,1:38:31.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总共107,000，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}107 all in,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.24,1:38:34.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外加一箱香槟，配你剩下的火鸡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}plus a case of champagne to go with your leftover turkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.04,1:38:38.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么样？别担心那孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you say? Don't worry about the boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.87,1:38:42.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他开得那么稳，你都能在引擎上煮鸡蛋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He drives so smooth, you can boil an egg on the engine.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.54,1:38:45.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等我们把车开回来，我帮你剥鸡蛋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When we bring the car back, I'll peel the egg for ya.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.75,1:38:50.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，你逗我笑了，可我不能让车开出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, you made me laugh, but I can't let the car go out.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.22,1:38:54.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要定金吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Want a deposit?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.26,1:38:56.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生，这不是分期付款的商品。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is not an installment item, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.98,1:39:03.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗雷迪，你也不年轻了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Freddie, you're no spring chicken.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.69,1:39:08.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道总部的人怎么叫我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what they call me at the home office?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.86,1:39:09.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“灰鬼”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"The Grey Ghost."
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.99,1:39:12.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道他们为什么还留着我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know why they still keep me around?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.28,1:39:15.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这儿没有哪个小子能像我一样把法拉利卖出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's no kid here that can move a Ferrari like I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.87,1:39:18.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从东海岸到西海岸都出名，就像黄油配吐司一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm known from coast to coast like butter and toast.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.49,1:39:20.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}随便问谁，都知道弗雷迪·比斯科。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ask anybody about Freddie Bisco.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.08,1:39:22.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要我卖法拉利……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When I get a Ferrari...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.46,1:39:24.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}立马开出门！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Out the door!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.54,1:39:27.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗雷迪，你刚把我逗笑了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just made me laugh, Freddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.30,1:39:28.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.21,1:39:30.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}两千。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}2,000.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.76,1:39:34.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要是不收，我就真要哭了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unless you take it, you're gonna make me cry.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.97,1:39:39.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也是个灰鬼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm a grey ghost, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.24,1:39:54.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看？这多有意思，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See? This is fun, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.88,1:40:12.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}挂空挡。滑进二挡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Drop her into neutral. Slide her into second.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.80,1:40:14.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}松离合。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pop the clutch.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.88,1:40:54.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直着。就这样保持住。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Straight. Hold it right like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.72,1:40:56.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感觉到了吗？这就是直。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Feel it? That's straight.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.01,1:40:59.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是条直路，保持直行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a straight street, so keep it straight.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.97,1:41:03.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}保持直行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep it straight.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.39,1:41:05.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}光保持直行多没劲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No fun just to keep it straight.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.23,1:41:08.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得稍微动一动，感受路面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've got to move a little bit, feel the road.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.31,1:41:11.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托？就这样。好吗？这就对了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please? Just like this. All right? There you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.98,1:41:13.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}慢慢来，别急。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take it nice and easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.65,1:41:16.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你喜欢这样吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.07,1:41:23.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校，慢一点。你开得有点快。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Slow it down a little, Colonel. You're goin' a little fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.12,1:41:26.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校，慢点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel, slow it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.25,1:41:29.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的脚出毛病了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Something's happened to my foot!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.00,1:41:32.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求你了，慢点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Slow it down, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.38,1:41:34.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。我觉得我还能再挂一挡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold on. I think I've got another gear.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.76,1:41:37.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斯莱德上校？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel Slade?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.88,1:41:40.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呼啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hoo-ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.14,1:41:42.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小心！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.43,1:41:47.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会害死我们的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll get us killed!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.56,1:41:49.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别怪我，查理，我看不见！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't blame me, Charlie, I can't see!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.48,1:41:53.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校，慢点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel, slow it down!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.45,1:42:05.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.37,1:42:09.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在看看这小家伙过弯怎么样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now let's see how this baby corners.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.21,1:42:10.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过弯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Corners?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.29,1:42:11.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。你说什么时候。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Say when.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.34,1:42:13.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说什么什么时候？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Say when what?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.50,1:42:14.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说什么时候转弯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Say when to turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.88,1:42:16.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校，你不能转弯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel, you can't turn the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.80,1:42:18.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理，转弯在哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's the turn, Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.01,1:42:22.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}3点钟方向？2点钟？右斜前方？向右转？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}3 o'clock? 2 o'clock? Right oblique? Right face?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.47,1:42:24.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快说啊！跟我说话！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on! Talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.26,1:42:26.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好像是左边。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's left, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.89,1:42:29.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}左边。我就知道。好。现在？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Left. I knew it. Okay. Now?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.14,1:42:33.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，不！不是现在！不是现在！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no! Not now! Not now!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.40,1:42:35.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.98,1:42:37.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校，求你了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.44,1:42:39.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}反正我都要做的，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna do it anyway, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.57,1:42:41.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管你同不同意，我们走了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whether you say so or not, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.70,1:42:44.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好！等等，等等，等等！先等等！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay! Wait, wait, wait! Just wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.24,1:42:46.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.49,1:42:48.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等……现在！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait... Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.75,1:42:57.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我做到了！噢，查理！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I did it! Oh, Charlie!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.42,1:43:02.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你正跟一个非常快乐的人同车！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're ridin' with one very happy man!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.80,1:43:05.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再转弯！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Turn again!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.35,1:43:06.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说具体点，小子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Be specific, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.22,1:43:08.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在左转！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Left now!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.43,1:43:09.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.44,1:43:17.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爱这个！太爽了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love this! I love it!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.65,1:43:20.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要不要玩到极限？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shall we take it to the max?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.82,1:43:22.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我下车。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.74,1:43:26.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈的！是警察。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shit! The yellow flag.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.45,1:43:30.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还没把她跑开呢。路边在哪边？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I haven't even opened her up yet. Which way's the curb?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.54,1:43:33.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}靠边停。慢点！慢点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pull over. Slow down! Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.21,1:43:34.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在停了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm doin' it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.46,1:43:36.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}靠边停，就这儿。慢点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pull over to the curb, here. Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.46,1:43:37.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。停好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yep. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.35,1:43:53.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。好多年没吃过罚单了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ooh. Haven't had a ticket in years.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.60,1:43:58.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来交涉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll do the talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.11,1:44:06.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}驾照和行驶证。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}License and registration.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.38,1:44:20.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这是在试驾这车？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you test-driving this baby?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.55,1:44:22.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她这嗓音不迷人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't she purr, though?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.80,1:44:24.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}时速七十英里？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At 70 miles an hour?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.68,1:44:27.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你该听听她跑一百二十五的时候。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You should hear her at 125.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.93,1:44:30.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的驾照呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's your license?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.43,1:44:33.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在车行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At the dealer's.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.10,1:44:36.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还车的时候他们就还给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They give it back when you return the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.60,1:44:39.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有身份证明吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got ID?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.32,1:44:40.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You bet.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.98,1:44:43.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}的确。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.36,1:44:49.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斯莱德中校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lieutenant Colonel Slade.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.82,1:44:51.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你呢，大兵？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you, soldier?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.41,1:44:54.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我叫戈尔警官。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The name is Police Officer Gore.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.62,1:44:58.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得不错啊，戈尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Doin' a hell of a job, Gore.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.83,1:45:00.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也是，上校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And so are you, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.96,1:45:03.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这小子是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's the kid?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.55,1:45:06.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的孩子，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My boy Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.59,1:45:08.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他一直叫我“放开了跑”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He kept tellin' me to "let her out."
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.64,1:45:10.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能怎么办，让他失望？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What was I gonna do, disappoint him?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.30,1:45:12.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.39,1:45:18.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟你说怎么办，上校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell you what I'm gonna do, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.56,1:45:21.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我放你走，但有个条件。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna let you go, on one condition.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.44,1:45:22.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么条件？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.02,1:45:25.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把这车直接开回车行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That you take this rig straight back to the dealer.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.07,1:45:29.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.66,1:45:30.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}闭嘴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.58,1:45:32.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要这个吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want this?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.37,1:45:34.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.58,1:45:37.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}戈尔？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gore?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.58,1:45:40.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的脸和声音我有点熟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your face and your voice are familiar.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.63,1:45:43.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你去过岘港的军官俱乐部吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You ever been in the officer's club at Da Nang?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.13,1:45:45.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.63,1:45:47.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没当过兵？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Never in the Army?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.34,1:45:49.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。海岸警卫队。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Coast Guard.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.59,1:45:52.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good Lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.68,1:45:59.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你爸看着精神不错，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your dad is looking good, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.94,1:46:03.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过他脚有点重。让他轻点，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's got a heavy foot, though. Tell him to take it light, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.73,1:46:06.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我听见了！  -好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I hear ya!   -All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.74,1:46:07.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.88,1:46:24.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下车，你不许再开了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out of the car, because you are not driving anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.17,1:46:26.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是让这宝贝热着，仅此而已。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just keeping this baby warm, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.67,1:46:30.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不开了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not drivin' anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.35,1:46:36.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.77,1:46:43.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-扶着我胳膊。  -我没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Take my arm.   -I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.15,1:46:46.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校，这路太不平了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel, it's really bumpy here.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.62,1:47:02.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.63,1:47:06.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.68,1:47:16.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}红灯。停下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Red light. Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.14,1:47:24.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等太久了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Taking too long.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.48,1:47:31.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈的！上校！上校！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shit! Colonel! Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.79,1:47:43.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.71,1:47:45.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈的！你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shit! You all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.71,1:47:48.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.80,1:47:49.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿着拐杖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take the cane.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.05,1:47:51.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要撒尿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I gotta take a piss.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.17,1:47:52.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿着拐杖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take the cane.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.47,1:47:53.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}人都会这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Happens to the best of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.80,1:47:55.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里是公园大道。你不能这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're on Park Avenue. You can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.80,1:47:57.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Perfect place.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.72,1:47:59.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会被抓的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll get arrested.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.72,1:48:01.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从来没被调教好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Never been housebroken.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.64,1:48:02.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校！妈的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.10,1:48:06.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么了，上校？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's the matter with you, Colonel?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.82,1:48:16.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在干什么？站起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing? Stand up.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.74,1:48:18.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.12,1:48:21.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我累了，查理。我累了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm tired, Charlie. I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.75,1:48:25.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把手给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me your arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.12,1:48:27.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的拐杖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here's your cane.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.09,1:48:31.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}送我回酒店，孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take me back to the hotel, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.39,1:48:39.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}终于到家了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Home at last.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.58,1:49:02.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你现在好点了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You all right now?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.16,1:49:05.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.25,1:49:11.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要用卫生间吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you want to use the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.54,1:49:12.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.76,1:49:23.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要我给你拿点什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I get you something?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.18,1:49:24.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.48,1:49:29.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你确定你没事吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You sure you're all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.77,1:49:31.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没事，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm fine, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.12,1:49:52.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你介意我用下电话吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you mind if I use the phone?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.80,1:49:53.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.98,1:50:14.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.48,1:50:16.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好，请问乔治在吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, is George there, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.36,1:50:17.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老乔治还是小乔治？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Senior or Junior?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.49,1:50:20.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小乔治。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Junior.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.95,1:50:22.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.49,1:50:23.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他学校里的朋友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A friend of his from school.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.95,1:50:28.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，乔治现在不会跟任何学校里的朋友说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry, but George isn't going to be talking to any friends from school right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.46,1:50:31.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.79,1:50:32.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.35,1:50:52.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校，你在看我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel, are you looking at me?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.48,1:50:57.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是瞎子，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm blind, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.53,1:51:05.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要打个盹。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna take a nap.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.08,1:51:09.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}新鲜空气吸太多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Too much fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.87,1:51:13.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这主意可能不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's probably a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.54,1:51:16.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要我扶你回房间吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Want me to help you to your room?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.55,1:51:18.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.92,1:51:21.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}沙发。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Couch.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.26,1:51:24.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我喜欢这张沙发。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I like this couch here.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.47,1:51:29.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你确定没事吧，上校？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You sure you're all right, Colonel?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.02,1:51:31.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我头疼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got a headache.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.94,1:51:40.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你下楼去给我买点阿司匹林吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't you go downstairs, get me some aspirin?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.11,1:51:43.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-买点阿司匹林。  -好。还有……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Some aspirin.   -Yeah. Also...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.95,1:51:48.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想抽根雪茄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I feel like a cigar.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.16,1:51:53.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我买几根蒙特克里斯托一号。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get me a couple of Montecristos Number One.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.75,1:51:56.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蒙特克里斯托一号。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Montecristos Number One.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.17,1:51:57.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.38,1:52:00.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}楼下报亭买不到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You won't be able to get 'em at the newsstand downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.26,1:52:02.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你不如去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So why don't you go over to
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.97,1:52:05.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}五十街和第五大道交叉口的登喜路店。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}50th and Fifth, Dunhill's.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.34,1:52:09.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}找那儿一个叫阿诺德的家伙，在雪茄保湿房。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fella named Arnold there, in the humidor.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.97,1:52:12.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉他这是给我买的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell him they're for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.98,1:52:15.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他会明白的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He'll know.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.15,1:53:06.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你回来得太快了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're back too fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.07,1:53:11.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没买到我的雪茄，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You didn't get my cigars, did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.92,1:53:18.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚出去，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out of here, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.05,1:53:25.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为我们说好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought we had a deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.80,1:53:29.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我反悔了。我就是个赖账的。我没告诉过你吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I welched. I'm a welcher. Didn't I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.18,1:53:34.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，你告诉我的是你把所有子弹都给我了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, what you told me was that you gave me all the bullets.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.06,1:53:36.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我撒谎了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I lied.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.19,1:53:39.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你骗得过我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You could have fooled me.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.15,1:53:41.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我确实骗了你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.23,1:53:47.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有我，你在这世上怎么活？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How you ever gonna survive in this world without me?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.49,1:53:55.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把枪给我吧，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't you just give me the gun, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.42,1:54:06.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.09,1:54:10.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也要开枪打你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna shoot you, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.10,1:54:15.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}反正你这辈子也完了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your life's finished anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.35,1:54:19.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你朋友乔治会像金丝雀一样全招了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your friend George is going to sing like a canary.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.35,1:54:21.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And so are you.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.19,1:54:23.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等你一招供，查理，我的孩子，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And once you've sung, Charlie, my boy,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.02,1:54:28.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就会站到那条长长的灰色队伍里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you're gonna take your place on that long, gray line
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.20,1:54:30.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}成为美国男人中的一员。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of American manhood.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.62,1:54:33.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后你就完了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you will be through.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.45,1:54:37.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校，我想反驳你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd like to disagree with you, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.54,1:54:39.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没资格反驳我，小子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're in no position to disagree with me, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.00,1:54:43.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我这儿是把上了膛的.45，你只有青春痘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got a loaded.45 here. You got pimples.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.13,1:54:45.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要杀了你，查理，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna kill ya, Charlie,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.55,1:54:50.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我受不了你出卖自己！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because I can't bear the thought of you sellin' out!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.18,1:54:54.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把枪放下，好吗，上校？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put the gun down, all right, Colonel?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.97,1:54:58.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？你在给我下最后通牒？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? You givin' me an ultimatum?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.27,1:54:59.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.14,1:55:03.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下最后通牒的是我！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I give the ultimatums!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.90,1:55:06.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.15,1:55:10.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吗？对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right? I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.16,1:55:14.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's all right,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.16,1:55:17.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.42,1:55:24.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你让我心碎，孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You break my heart, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.09,1:55:27.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我这辈子都在反抗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All my life I stood up
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.88,1:55:30.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有人、所有事，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to everyone and everything,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.18,1:55:36.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为那让我觉得自己很重要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because it made me feel important.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.31,1:55:40.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你做是因为你真心如此。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You do it 'cause you mean it.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.06,1:55:45.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有骨气，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got integrity, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.03,1:55:53.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我都不知道该毙了你还是收养你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know whether to shoot you or adopt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.20,1:55:58.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这选择可不怎么样，是吧，长官？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not much of a choice, is it, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.66,1:56:00.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，别耍贫嘴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. Don't get cute now.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.20,1:56:03.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求你把枪收起来好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Could you please put the gun away?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.29,1:56:05.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我问你一个问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I asked you a question.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.42,1:56:08.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想不想让我收养你？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you want me to adopt you, or don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.50,1:56:11.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求你了？我是说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please? I mean...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.80,1:56:15.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只是现在状态低迷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're just in a slump right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.30,1:56:16.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}低迷？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Slump?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.22,1:56:21.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是低迷，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No slump, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.23,1:56:24.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是坏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.40,1:56:29.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是坏。不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not bad. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.11,1:56:33.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是烂透了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm rotten.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.91,1:56:38.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不坏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.79,1:56:43.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只是痛苦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're just in pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.25,1:56:51.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你懂什么叫痛苦？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you know about pain?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.26,1:56:59.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这个小西北太平洋的蜗牛镖鲈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You little snail darter from the Pacific Northwest.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.76,1:57:02.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你他妈懂什么叫痛苦？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fuck you know about pain?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.39,1:57:08.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把枪给我，上校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me have the gun, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.27,1:57:11.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没时间长出鸡巴了，小子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No time to grow a dick, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.48,1:57:15.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把枪给我就行了，好吗，上校？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just give me the gun, all right, Colonel?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.28,1:57:19.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在说阅兵场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm talkin' a parade ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.45,1:57:20.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}立正！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ten-hut!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.62,1:57:26.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}士兵，这是直接命令。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Soldier, that was a direct order.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.75,1:57:30.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把枪给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me the gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.26,1:57:36.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以留下，也可以走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can stay or you can leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.09,1:57:39.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.93,1:57:42.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管怎样，这事我都要做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Either way, I'm gonna do this thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.39,1:57:49.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你干嘛不走，省得难受？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now why don't you leave and spare yourself?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.11,1:57:54.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要你的枪，上校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want your gun, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.03,1:58:05.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我给自己数数。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna give myself a count.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.46,1:58:13.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你需要数数来保持平衡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You need a count for balance.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.42,1:58:17.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}五……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Five...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.13,1:58:20.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}四……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Four...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.84,1:58:23.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Three...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:25.47,1:58:26.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}二……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Two...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.35,1:58:30.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.65,1:58:33.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去他的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.45,1:58:43.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我！操！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me! Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.49,1:58:47.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:47.79,1:58:49.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就待在这儿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm stayin' right here!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.29,1:58:50.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚开！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.46,1:58:51.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就在这儿不走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm stayin' right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.92,1:58:53.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一枪打烂你的脑袋！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll blow your fuckin' head off!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.58,1:58:55.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就动手啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.38,1:58:57.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想动手？动手啊！来啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want to do it? Do it! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.80,1:59:05.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚开！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.35,1:59:09.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是搞砸了，那又怎样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You fucked up, all right? So what?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.73,1:59:11.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁都会搞砸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So everybody does it.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.27,1:59:13.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}继续过日子吧，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get on with your life, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.06,1:59:15.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么日子？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What life?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.40,1:59:18.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我根本没有日子可过！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got no life!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.44,1:59:22.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我活在黑暗里！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm in the dark here!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.41,1:59:25.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你明白吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.28,1:59:28.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在黑暗里！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm in the dark!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.42,1:59:35.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就放弃吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So give up.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.67,1:59:40.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想放弃就放弃。因为我也要放弃。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want to give up, give up. Because I'm givin' up, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.46,1:59:42.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说我完了。你说得对，我完了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You said I'm through. You're right, I am through.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.76,1:59:44.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们都完了。全都结束了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're both through. It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:45.43,1:59:47.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就来吧。他妈的动手吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So let's get on with it. Let's fuckin' do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.81,1:59:52.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}扣扳机吧，你这个可怜瞎眼的混蛋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's fuckin' pull the trigger, you miserable blind motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.32,2:00:02.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}扣扳机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.95,2:00:06.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来了，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here we go, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.16,2:00:09.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我准备好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.46,2:00:19.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不想死。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.67,2:00:23.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也不想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And neither do you.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.97,2:00:29.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我一个不死的理由。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me one reason not to.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.14,2:00:35.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我给你两个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll give you two.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.73,2:00:40.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跳探戈、开法拉利，比我见过的任何人都强。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can dance the tango and drive a Ferrari better than anyone I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.66,2:00:48.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你根本没见过别人跳探戈、开法拉利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You never seen anyone do either.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.41,2:00:54.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把枪给我，上校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me the gun, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.47,2:01:08.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，查理，我接下来该往哪儿走？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, where do I go from here, Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.51,2:01:12.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}纠结了就继续跳探戈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you're tangled up, just tango on.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:15.02,2:01:17.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是在请我跳舞吗，查理？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You askin' me to dance, Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:24.53,2:01:27.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可曾有过那种感觉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you ever have the feelin'
Dialogue: 0,2:01:27.61,2:01:29.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想离开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That you wanted to go
Dialogue: 0,2:01:30.99,2:01:35.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}却又觉得想留下？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And still had the feelin' that you wanted to stay?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:51.93,2:01:54.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你喜欢我的蓝调吗，查理？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You like my blues, Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.48,2:01:59.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喜欢，很美。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, they're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:00.69,2:02:02.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我穿这身\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wore these
Dialogue: 0,2:02:04.28,2:02:06.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去参加林登的就职典礼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for Lyndon's inauguration.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.57,2:02:12.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然，我们去的不是头号舞会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course, we weren't the number one ball.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.41,2:02:18.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过他还是顺道来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But he dropped by anyway.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.00,2:02:23.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求你把枪给我，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you please give me the gun?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.34,2:02:29.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是在要求一名军官\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're askin' an officer
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.43,2:02:32.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}交出他的佩枪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to surrender his sidearm.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.39,2:02:36.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用你交出。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't have to surrender it.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.52,2:02:38.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是先放下一会儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just put it down for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.60,2:02:41.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吗？放下吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right? Just put it down.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.62,2:02:55.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，我真想喝一杯，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Boy, I could use a drink, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.62,2:03:01.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来杯咖啡怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How about a cup of coffee?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.25,2:03:07.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在让我跨这么大步太难了，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Too big a leap for me right now, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.67,2:03:08.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许明天吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.80,2:03:16.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我更想要约翰·丹尼尔斯先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, a Mr. John Daniels would be preferred.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:18.81,2:03:20.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要加水，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No water, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:23.19,2:03:24.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不加水。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No water.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.27,2:03:26.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:34.66,2:03:36.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}您的酒，上校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here's your drink, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.21,2:03:45.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，真抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.96,2:03:48.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}您想让我几点来铺床？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What time do you want me to turn down the bed?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:48.76,2:03:50.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚点吧，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe later, all right?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:50.76,2:03:52.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的意思是，小姐，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What he means, sefiorita,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.76,2:03:55.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让你现在就进来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is come right in.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.31,2:04:00.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请晚点再来？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Later, please?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:01.73,2:04:04.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好的，先生。下午好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, sir. Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:08.73,2:04:10.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}声音真不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice voice.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.70,2:04:16.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，你脑子里只有一件事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Boy, you have a one-track mind.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:18.95,2:04:22.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这世上还有别的事吗，查理？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is there anything else in this world, Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.25,2:04:24.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对你来说没有了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:25.75,2:04:28.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道这些年是什么撑着我活下来的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what's kept me goin' all these years?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:29.71,2:04:31.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是想着\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The thought
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.72,2:04:35.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有一天……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that one day...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:43.89,2:04:45.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}算了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.56,2:04:47.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想着什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The what?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:49.73,2:04:50.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太傻了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Silly.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.78,2:04:56.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是想着也许有一天，我能……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just the thought that maybe one day, I'd...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:00.74,2:05:03.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能有个女人用双臂搂着我，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I could have a woman's arms wrapped around me,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:05.46,2:05:07.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用双腿缠着我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and her legs wrapped around me.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.50,2:05:11.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And what?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.68,2:05:21.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能早上醒来，她还在那里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That I could wake up in the morning and she'd still be there.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:22.52,2:05:23.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她的气息。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Smell of her.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:25.52,2:05:27.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又暖又带着点体味。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All funky and warm.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:31.82,2:05:33.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最后我放弃了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I finally gave up on it.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.03,2:05:39.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不明白你为什么不能拥有这些。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know why you can't have that.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.74,2:05:45.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等我们回到新罕布什尔，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When we get back to New Hampshire,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:45.29,2:05:47.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不明白你为什么找不到人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know why you can't find someone.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:48.04,2:05:51.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你长得挺帅\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a good-lookin' guy
Dialogue: 0,2:05:51.79,2:05:53.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又讨人喜欢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you're fun to be with
Dialogue: 0,2:05:54.59,2:05:57.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是个很棒的旅伴，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you're a great travel companion,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:57.97,2:06:00.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}体贴，有同情心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}sensitive, compassionate.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:04.81,2:06:05.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:07.23,2:06:09.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你他妈是在耍我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}are you fuckin' with me?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.40,2:06:14.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:18.86,2:06:20.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.91,2:06:22.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，曼尼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Manny.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:27.83,2:06:28.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们误了飞机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We missed our plane.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:29.00,2:06:31.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是你的飞机，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your plane, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.17,2:06:32.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的机票是单程的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My ticket was one-way.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:34.84,2:06:37.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一路走新英格兰收费公路，上校？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}New England Thruway all the way, Colonel?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.26,2:06:38.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一路走，曼诺洛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All the way, Manolo.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.19,2:06:54.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我又感觉到那种沉重的感觉了，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gettin' that heavy feelin' again, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:56.07,2:06:57.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:58.11,2:06:59.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“呃……”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Uh..."
Dialogue: 0,2:07:00.28,2:07:03.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想你对乔治和他父亲的看法是对的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think you were right about George and his father.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:03.87,2:07:05.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听到这个我很难过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.95,2:07:10.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们回去后，特拉斯克先生要在全校面前审我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When we get back Mr. Trask is bringing us up in front of the whole school.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.92,2:07:12.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把你们架在火上烤？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Puttin' your feet to the fire?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:13.13,2:07:15.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}纪律委员会特别会议。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Special meeting of the disciplinary committee.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.59,2:07:19.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你打算跟他们说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And what are you gonna tell 'em?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:22.88,2:07:25.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。我会想点说辞。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. I'll think of somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:27.18,2:07:30.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理，为什么这事里你总是孤身一人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie, why are you all alone in this thing?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.85,2:07:32.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:32.98,2:07:34.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你父亲呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's your father?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:36.23,2:07:37.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He left.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.15,2:07:43.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还以为是夫妻店。那“夫”是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought it was a mom-and-pop store. Who's the pop?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:43.91,2:07:45.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我继父。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's my stepfather.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:46.74,2:07:48.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.70,2:07:54.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那他为什么不管这事？他有什么问题吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But why isn't he in on this? Somethin' wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.71,2:07:58.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，他还行。我们只是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, he's okay. We just...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:58.67,2:08:00.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们相处得不太好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We don't get along very well.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:00.34,2:08:01.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么不好？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.30,2:08:04.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为他是个混蛋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because he's an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.56,2:08:12.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那也没关系，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that's all right, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:14.94,2:08:17.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在家家都有一个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every family's got one nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:47.84,2:08:49.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这些？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:49.43,2:08:50.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这些。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:50.68,2:08:51.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}照顾好自己，孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take care of yourself, kid.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:52.06,2:08:53.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好的，曼尼。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, Manny. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:59.82,2:09:01.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我不开门。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I'm not opening.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:03.32,2:09:04.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我讨厌告别。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hate goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:07.53,2:09:08.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.95,2:09:11.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会没事的，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll be all right, huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.95,2:09:14.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会没事的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:15.96,2:09:17.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:20.54,2:09:22.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.00,2:09:24.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第一遍上课铃。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's first bell.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:26.34,2:09:28.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}正好还有时间收拾一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just got time to get cleaned up.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:30.72,2:09:31.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:32.10,2:09:34.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我差点忘了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:38.10,2:09:40.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我欠你一些钱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I owe you some money.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:42.48,2:09:45.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三百块。干得不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}$300. Job well done.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:49.95,2:09:52.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要是需要推荐人，查理，尽管找我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You ever need any references, Charlie, I'm your man.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:54.87,2:09:56.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢，上校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:03.13,2:10:06.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}水街16号。过桥就是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}16 Water Street. Over the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:06.30,2:10:07.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们会找到的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll find it.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:08.88,2:10:10.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goodbye, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:12.18,2:10:14.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见，上校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goodbye, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:17.06,2:10:18.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来，孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come here, son.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:35.45,2:10:36.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，曼尼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, Manny.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:51.15,2:11:53.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乔治。乔治！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}George. George!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:32.19,2:12:35.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天早上我召集了本校的一次公开会议\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I called an open meeting of this institution this morning
Dialogue: 0,2:12:35.20,2:12:38.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为上周二发生的事件\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because the incident that occurred this Tuesday last
Dialogue: 0,2:12:38.32,2:12:42.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}反映了一个关乎我们所有人的问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}describes an issue that concerns all of us.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:43.91,2:12:46.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不是一起孤立的破坏公物事件。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not an isolated case of vandalism.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:46.29,2:12:50.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所发生的一切是社会病症的一个症状。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What happened is a symptom of the sickness of a society.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.21,2:12:57.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这种病症与本校创校原则背道而驰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A sickness which runs counter to the principles this school was founded on.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:59.76,2:13:02.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}本校的毕业生中\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A school among whose graduates
Dialogue: 0,2:13:02.31,2:13:06.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有两位曾坐在白宫椭圆形办公室的办公桌后。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}two have sat behind the desk in the Oval Office, in the White House.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:08.10,2:13:11.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贝尔德人执掌过国务院和投资公司，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Baird men have run State Departments and investment houses,
Dialogue: 0,2:13:12.23,2:13:15.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}创办过百货商店，执教过橄榄球队。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}founded department stores and coached football teams.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:15.32,2:13:18.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的校友在印度的静修所里收到校刊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Our alumni receive their bulletins in ashrams in India
Dialogue: 0,2:13:19.24,2:13:21.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在约旦的宫殿里收到校刊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and in palaces in Jordan.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:21.28,2:13:23.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}事实上，我们在全世界都闻名\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are, in fact, known around the world
Dialogue: 0,2:13:23.66,2:13:26.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}被誉为这个国家领导人的摇篮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as the cradle of this country's leadership.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:26.87,2:13:28.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—一座灯塔……  -—你在这里干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-A beacon in the...   -What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.92,2:13:30.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上面有我的位置吗，查理？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got room for me up there, Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:30.75,2:13:33.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但今天我们正因不受尊重而流血。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But today we are bleeding from disrespect.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:33.88,2:13:35.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我想有吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:35.22,2:13:36.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—公然的不尊重。  -—拉我们一把。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Blatant disrespect.   -Give us a hand.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:37.05,2:13:39.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对我们的价值观不尊重，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A disrespect for our values,
Dialogue: 0,2:13:39.34,2:13:42.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对我们的标准不尊重。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and a disrespect for our standards.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:43.14,2:13:46.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对贝尔德传统不尊重。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A disrespect for the Baird tradition.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:46.52,2:13:49.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而作为那传统的守护者，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, as the custodians of that tradition,
Dialogue: 0,2:13:50.31,2:13:54.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们今天在这里是为了保护彼此\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we are here today to protect each other
Dialogue: 0,2:13:55.28,2:13:57.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}免受那些威胁它的人的侵害。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}from those who threaten it.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:58.86,2:14:00.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这位是谁，西姆斯先生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who is this, Mr. Simms?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:03.04,2:14:04.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这位是弗兰克·斯莱德先生，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is Mr. Frank Slade,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:05.70,2:14:09.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}美国陆军退役中校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lieutenant Colonel, United States Army, retired.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:10.29,2:14:12.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来这里代替查理的父母。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm here in place of Charlie's parents.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:12.88,2:14:14.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:14.46,2:14:16.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}代行父母之责。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In loco parentis.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:18.34,2:14:21.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们今天无法从俄勒冈赶来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They could not make the trip from Oregon today.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:21.76,2:14:24.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你和西姆斯先生是什么关系？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And what is your relationship to Mr. Simms?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:24.81,2:14:26.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里是法庭吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is this a courtroom?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:27.35,2:14:29.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我们能弄到的最接近法庭的地方了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Closest thing we could manage to it.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:29.48,2:14:33.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那要是宣誓的话，我倒想给几个人主持宣誓。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then if we're taking oaths, there's a few people I'd like to swear in.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:35.40,2:14:37.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贝尔德没有宣誓这一说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There are no oaths at Baird.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:38.74,2:14:40.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们全靠荣誉自律。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are all on our honor.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:42.70,2:14:47.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拉里和弗兰妮·西姆斯是我非常亲密的挚友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Larry and Franny Simms are very dear, close friends of mine.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:48.37,2:14:51.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们请我代表查理到场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They've asked me to appear here on Charlie's behalf.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:52.54,2:14:53.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:56.34,2:14:58.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很高兴您能来，上校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Happy to have you with us, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:03.05,2:15:04.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}威利斯先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Willis.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:06.72,2:15:08.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哪位威利斯先生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which Mr. Willis?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:08.48,2:15:09.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小乔治，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}George, Junior, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:14.98,2:15:16.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:16.57,2:15:21.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上周二晚上，你有机会看到是谁干了这起破坏行为。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You were in a position last Tuesday night to see who committed this act of vandalism.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:21.45,2:15:22.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:24.87,2:15:28.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，我大概猜到是谁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I have an idea who it was.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:28.37,2:15:29.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，不是猜到，威利斯先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, not an idea, Mr. Willis.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:29.91,2:15:31.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底看见还是没看见？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you see or did you not see?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:34.63,2:15:36.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:37.76,2:15:40.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没戴隐形眼镜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't have my contacts in.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:44.26,2:15:45.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:49.39,2:15:52.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在图书馆，摘了眼镜，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was in the library. I'd taken my glasses off,
Dialogue: 0,2:15:52.48,2:15:55.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}正准备换回隐形眼镜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I was gonna put my contacts back in.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:00.40,2:16:02.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后我帮西姆斯关灯锁门，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then I helped Simms close up
Dialogue: 0,2:16:02.40,2:16:05.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}接着我们就在外面了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and the next thing I know, we're outside,
Dialogue: 0,2:16:05.41,2:16:07.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听到一个声音，我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I hear this sound and I
Dialogue: 0,2:16:09.41,2:16:12.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}根本来不及戴隐形眼镜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}didn't have any time to put my contacts in.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:12.92,2:16:15.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以你有限的视力，你看见了谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whom, with your limited vision, did you see?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:33.27,2:16:35.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说了，很模糊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like I say, it was blurry.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:41.28,2:16:43.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不戴隐形眼镜我看不清。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't see without my contacts.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:43.90,2:16:46.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看见了什么，威利斯先生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did you see, Mr. Willis?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:46.49,2:16:47.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:48.83,2:16:50.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}您是说确定地？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You mean definitively?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:50.41,2:16:52.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别跟我绕圈子，威利斯先生！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop fencing with me, Mr. Willis!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:52.20,2:16:54.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉我你看见了什么！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell me what you saw!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:59.17,2:17:03.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别拿这个当真，不过没戴隐形眼镜，天又黑……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, don't hold me to this, but no contacts, it's dark...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:05.84,2:17:07.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且一切，我是说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And everything, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:07.55,2:17:08.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}威利斯先生！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Willis!
Dialogue: 0,2:17:11.97,2:17:13.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:15.48,2:17:17.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈里·哈弗迈耶，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry Havemeyer,
Dialogue: 0,2:17:18.31,2:17:21.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}特伦特·波特和吉米·詹姆森。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Trent Potter and Jimmy Jameson.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:25.49,2:17:26.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:26.61,2:17:28.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大致估计，最靠谱的猜测。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ballpark, best guess.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:30.49,2:17:33.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能提供一些细节吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Could you provide us with some detail?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:35.87,2:17:39.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你干吗不问查理？我觉得他离得更近。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't you ask Charlie? I really think he was closer.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:48.43,2:17:49.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}西姆斯先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Simms.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:50.72,2:17:52.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:52.76,2:17:55.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不戴隐形眼镜，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't wear contact lenses, do you?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:55.60,2:17:56.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不戴，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:58.52,2:18:02.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你毫无遮挡的视力，看见了谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With your untrammeled sight, whom did you see?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:06.94,2:18:08.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看见了点什么，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I saw something,
Dialogue: 0,2:18:10.66,2:18:13.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我说不出是谁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I couldn't say who.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:13.91,2:18:16.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。你看见的“什么”是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. What was the something you saw?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:20.67,2:18:21.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说不出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I couldn't say.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:21.88,2:18:23.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是说不出来，还是不愿说？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You couldn't or wouldn't say?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:26.42,2:18:27.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I just...
Dialogue: 0,2:18:31.80,2:18:33.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是说不出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just couldn't say.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:33.35,2:18:34.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不能、不愿、不该。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Couldn't, wouldn't, shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:34.93,2:18:38.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在耗尽我的耐心，把这场程序当儿戏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're exhausting my patience and making a mockery of these proceedings.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:38.52,2:18:40.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我给你最后一次机会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will give you one last chance.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:40.23,2:18:42.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你回答的后果会很严重。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The consequences of your response will be dire.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:42.69,2:18:47.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}严重是指你的前途将永久受损。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By dire, I mean your future will be jeopardized permanently.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:48.57,2:18:50.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最后一次，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now for the last time,
Dialogue: 0,2:18:50.66,2:18:54.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上周二晚上你在我办公室外看见了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}what did you see last Tuesday night outside my office?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:59.12,2:19:00.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看见了某个人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw somebody.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:01.00,2:19:03.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“我看见了某个人。”很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"I saw somebody." Good.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:04.38,2:19:06.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看见他们的体型和轮廓了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you see their size and shape?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:08.17,2:19:09.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看见了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:10.26,2:19:12.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那他们的体型和轮廓像谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And they were the size and shape of whom?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:18.43,2:19:20.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们的体型和轮廓\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They were the size and shape
Dialogue: 0,2:19:35.62,2:19:37.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟贝尔德大多数学生都差不多，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of most any Baird student, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:52.72,2:19:55.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一个真正的证人也没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am left with no real witness.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:56.76,2:20:00.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}威利斯先生的证词不仅含糊，而且毫无依据。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Willis' testimony is not only vague, it is unsubstantiated.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:00.81,2:20:05.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想要的实质内容，西姆斯先生，本该由你提供。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The substance I was looking for, Mr. Simms, was to come from you.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:09.23,2:20:10.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:12.15,2:20:14.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也很遗憾，西姆斯先生，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry, too, Mr. Simms,
Dialogue: 0,2:20:15.07,2:20:16.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你知道我要怎么做，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because you know what I'm going to do
Dialogue: 0,2:20:17.12,2:20:21.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}既然我不能惩罚哈弗迈耶、波特或詹姆森先生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}inasmuch as I can't punish Mr. Havemeyer, Mr. Potter or Mr. Jameson?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:22.04,2:20:24.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也不会惩罚威利斯先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I won't punish Mr. Willis.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:24.67,2:20:26.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是这起事件中唯一\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's the only party to this incident
Dialogue: 0,2:20:26.75,2:20:29.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还配自称贝尔德人的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who is still worthy of calling himself a Baird man.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:30.80,2:20:34.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要向纪律委员会建议\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm going to recommend to the disciplinary committee
Dialogue: 0,2:20:35.80,2:20:37.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}将你开除。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that you be expelled.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:37.89,2:20:42.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}西姆斯先生，你是个掩盖真相的高手，也是个骗子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Simms, you are a cover-up artist and you are a liar.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:42.18,2:20:44.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但不是告密者！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But not a snitch!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:45.65,2:20:47.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:47.19,2:20:48.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我看我不会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I don't think I will.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:48.77,2:20:50.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斯莱德先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Slade.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:50.32,2:20:52.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这简直是胡扯！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is such a crock of shit!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:54.07,2:20:56.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请注意言辞，斯莱德先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please watch your language, Mr. Slade.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:56.45,2:20:59.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在贝尔德学校，不是军营。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are in the Baird school, not a barracks.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:59.70,2:21:02.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}西姆斯先生，我给你最后一次开口的机会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Simms, I will give you one final opportunity to speak up.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:02.79,2:21:04.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}西姆斯先生不想要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Simms doesn't want it.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:05.54,2:21:09.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不需要被贴上“还配做贝尔德人”的标签。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He doesn't need to be labeled "still worthy of being a Baird man."
Dialogue: 0,2:21:09.92,2:21:11.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那到底是什么鬼东西？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:12.00,2:21:14.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们这里的座右铭是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is your motto here?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:14.17,2:21:18.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“孩子们，告发同学，保住自己，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Boys, inform on your classmates, save your hide,
Dialogue: 0,2:21:18.39,2:21:21.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“做不到，我们就把你绑上火刑柱？”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"anything short of that, we're gonna burn you at the stake?"
Dialogue: 0,2:21:21.81,2:21:23.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各位先生，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,2:21:24.02,2:21:27.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大难临头时，有人逃跑，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when the shit hits the fan, some guys run,
Dialogue: 0,2:21:27.56,2:21:29.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人留下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and some guys stay.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:29.23,2:21:32.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这位查理，直面烈火，而那位乔治，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here's Charlie, facin' the fire, and there's George,
Dialogue: 0,2:21:32.82,2:21:35.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}躲在他老爸的口袋里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}hidin' in big daddy's pocket.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:35.36,2:21:36.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你们在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And what are you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:37.03,2:21:40.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们要奖励乔治，毁掉查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're gonna reward George and destroy Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:42.74,2:21:44.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说完了吗，斯莱德先生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you finished, Mr. Slade?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:44.37,2:21:46.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，我才刚热身。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I'm just gettin' warmed up.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:47.54,2:21:49.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道谁在这儿念过书。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know who went to this place.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:49.75,2:21:52.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}威廉·霍华德·塔夫脱、威廉·詹宁斯·布莱恩，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}William Howard Taft, William Jennings Bryan,
Dialogue: 0,2:21:52.84,2:21:54.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}威廉·退尔，随便谁吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}William Tell, whoever.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:54.42,2:21:57.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们的精神已经死了，如果说他们有过的话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Their spirit is dead, if they ever had one.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:57.84,2:21:59.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}消失了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:59.18,2:22:01.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们在这儿造一艘老鼠船，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're buildin' a rat ship here,
Dialogue: 0,2:22:02.14,2:22:04.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一艘供告密者出海航行的船。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a vessel for seagoin' snitches.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:05.14,2:22:08.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你以为你们在把这些小鱼培养成男人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And if you think you're preparin' these minnows for manhood,
Dialogue: 0,2:22:08.94,2:22:10.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你最好再想想，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you better think again,
Dialogue: 0,2:22:10.73,2:22:16.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我说你们正在扼杀这所学校宣称要灌输的精神。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because I say you are killin' the very spirit this institution proclaims it instills.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:17.65,2:22:19.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是虚伪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What a sham.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:19.32,2:22:22.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们今天在这儿演的什么戏？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What kind of a show are you guys puttin' on here today?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:22.37,2:22:25.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这场戏里唯一有品格的，就坐在我旁边。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The only class in this act is sittin' next to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:25.87,2:22:29.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来告诉你们，这孩子的灵魂完好无损。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I'm here to tell you this boy's soul is intact.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:29.79,2:22:32.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这没得商量。知道我为什么知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's non-negotiable. You know how I know?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:32.59,2:22:36.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这儿有人，我不说是谁，想买它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Someone here, and I won't say who, offered to buy it.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:36.63,2:22:38.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有查理不卖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Only Charlie here wasn't sellin'.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:38.84,2:22:40.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生，你违反程序了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir, you're out of order.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:40.26,2:22:42.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我倒想让你看看什么叫违反程序。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd show you out of order.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:42.68,2:22:45.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你根本不知道什么叫违反程序，特拉斯克先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't know what out of order is, Mr. Trask.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:45.77,2:22:47.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想示范给你看，但我太老了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd show you, but I'm too old,
Dialogue: 0,2:22:47.89,2:22:50.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我太累了，我他妈太瞎了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm too tired, I'm too fuckin' blind.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:50.56,2:22:55.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我还是五年前的我，我就拿火焰喷射器烧了这地方！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I were the man I was five years ago, I'd take a flamethrower to this place!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:58.90,2:23:02.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}违反程序？你以为你在跟谁说话？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Out of order? Who the hell you think you're talkin' to?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:03.83,2:23:05.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我什么没见过，你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've been around, you know?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:06.58,2:23:08.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我曾经看得见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There was a time I could see.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:09.16,2:23:10.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我见过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I have seen.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:11.37,2:23:13.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像这样的孩子，比他们还小的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Boys like these, younger than these,
Dialogue: 0,2:23:13.92,2:23:17.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胳膊被炸断，腿被扯掉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}their arms torn out, their legs ripped off.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:17.76,2:23:22.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但没什么比得上灵魂被截肢的景象。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But there is nothin' like the sight of an amputated spirit.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:22.93,2:23:25.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那没有假肢可装。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There is no prosthetic for that.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:27.35,2:23:30.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为你只是把这个出色的步兵\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think you're merely sendin' this splendid foot soldier
Dialogue: 0,2:23:30.94,2:23:34.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}夹着尾巴送回俄勒冈老家，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}back home to Oregon with his tail between his legs,
Dialogue: 0,2:23:34.23,2:23:38.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我说你们是在处决他的灵魂！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I say you are executin' his soul!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:39.40,2:23:40.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And why?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:41.74,2:23:43.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为他不是贝尔德人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because he's not a Baird man.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:44.78,2:23:47.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贝尔德人。你们伤害这孩子，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Baird men. You hurt this boy,
Dialogue: 0,2:23:47.79,2:23:50.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们全都是一群贝尔德混混。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you're gonna be Baird bums, the lot of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:50.62,2:23:52.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有，哈里、吉米，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, Harry, Jimmy,
Dialogue: 0,2:23:53.75,2:23:56.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}特伦特，不管你们在哪儿，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Trent, wherever you are out there,
Dialogue: 0,2:23:56.54,2:23:57.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也去你们的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}fuck you, too!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:00.76,2:24:02.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退下，斯莱德先生！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stand down, Mr. Slade!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:02.72,2:24:04.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还没说完。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not finished.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:05.26,2:24:09.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我进来的时候，听到那些话，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As I came in here, I heard those words,
Dialogue: 0,2:24:09.72,2:24:11.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“领袖的摇篮。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"cradle of leadership."
Dialogue: 0,2:24:12.89,2:24:18.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}俗话说，“树枝断了，摇篮就会掉下来”，它在这儿掉下来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, "when the bough breaks, the cradle will fall," and it has fallen here.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:18.32,2:24:19.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它掉下来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It has fallen.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:19.98,2:24:22.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}培养男人的人，塑造领袖的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Makers of men, creators of leaders.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:23.07,2:24:26.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小心你们在这儿培养出什么样的领袖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Be careful what kind of leaders you're producin' here.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:27.41,2:24:31.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道查理今天保持沉默是对是错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know if Charlie's silence here today is right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:31.75,2:24:33.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是法官，也不是陪审团。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not a judge or jury.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:33.25,2:24:34.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我可以告诉你们，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I can tell you this,
Dialogue: 0,2:24:35.08,2:24:38.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不会出卖任何人来换取自己的前途！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}he won't sell anybody out to buy his future!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:40.05,2:24:43.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}朋友们，这就叫正直。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that, my friends, is called integrity.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:44.22,2:24:46.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就叫勇气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's called courage.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:46.26,2:24:49.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这才是领袖该有的品质。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now that's the stuff leaders should be made of.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:54.94,2:24:58.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我已经走到了人生的十字路口。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now I have come to the crossroads in my life.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:59.69,2:25:02.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直知道正确的路是哪条。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I always knew what the right path was.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:03.94,2:25:07.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}无一例外，我知道，但我从没走过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Without exception, I knew, but I never took it.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:07.91,2:25:09.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道为什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know why?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:09.95,2:25:12.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为太难了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was too damn hard.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:14.58,2:25:17.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在轮到查理了。他也走到了十字路口。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now here's Charlie. He's come to the crossroads.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:17.88,2:25:21.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他选了一条路。是正确的路。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He has chosen a path. It's the right path.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:22.13,2:25:25.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一条由原则铺成、通向品格的路。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a path made of principle that leads to character.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:28.97,2:25:31.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让他继续走下去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let him continue on his journey.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:33.35,2:25:36.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}委员会，这孩子的未来掌握在你们手里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You hold this boy's future in your hands, committee.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:37.98,2:25:41.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}相信我，这是宝贵的未来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a valuable future, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:42.94,2:25:45.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别毁掉它。保护它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't destroy it. Protect it.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:47.16,2:25:48.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拥抱它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Embrace it.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:49.32,2:25:52.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我保证，总有一天你们会为他骄傲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's gonna make you proud one day, I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:10.01,2:26:12.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这段煽情怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How's that for cornball?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:33.62,2:26:35.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生，什么都堵不住他们的嘴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing can shut them up, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:40.08,2:26:43.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}纪律委员会将审议此事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The disciplinary committee will take this matter under advisement
Dialogue: 0,2:26:43.46,2:26:45.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}闭门进行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in closed session.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:53.64,2:26:55.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们在干什么，查理？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are they doin', Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:56.64,2:26:59.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想他们现在要做出决定了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think they're going to come to a decision now.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:03.06,2:27:04.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:10.03,2:27:12.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看来那个会没必要开了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Apparently, that meeting will be unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:13.62,2:27:15.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}汉萨克太太。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mrs. Hunsaker.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:19.25,2:27:24.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}学生与教工联合纪律委员会无需再开会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The joint student-faculty disciplinary committee needs no further sessions.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:24.71,2:27:27.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们已经做出决定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They have come to a decision.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:27.34,2:27:31.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈弗迈耶、波特和詹姆森三位先生被判留校察看\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Messrs. Havemeyer, Potter and Jameson are placed on probation
Dialogue: 0,2:27:32.34,2:27:35.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因涉嫌有失绅士风度的行为。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for suspicion of ungentlemanly conduct.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:35.64,2:27:39.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}委员会还建议小乔治·威利斯先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is further recommended that Mr. George Willis, Jr.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:39.18,2:27:42.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不予任何表彰或嘉奖\N{\rEN\blur0.8}receive neither recognition nor commendation
Dialogue: 0,2:27:42.27,2:27:44.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就其合作而言。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for his cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:45.48,2:27:50.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查尔斯·西姆斯先生无需再就此事作出任何回应。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Charles Simms is excused from any further response to this incident.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:50.57,2:27:51.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呼哈！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hoo-ah!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:51.21,2:28:52.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最后一步。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Last step.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:52.67,2:28:54.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理，我总能指望你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can always count on you, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:58.18,2:28:59.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:03.18,2:29:05.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是克里斯汀·唐斯，斯莱德上校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm Christine Downes, Colonel Slade.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:05.19,2:29:06.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我教政治学。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I teach political science.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:06.86,2:29:10.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想告诉你，我非常欣赏你直言不讳。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wanted to tell you how much I appreciate you speaking your mind.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:10.28,2:29:12.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，谢谢。你结婚了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why, thank you. Are you married?
Dialogue: 0,2:29:13.44,2:29:14.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I...
Dialogue: 0,2:29:17.16,2:29:20.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在锡尔堡炮兵学校时，认识一个叫米基·唐斯的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Went to an artillery school at Fort Sill with a Mickey Downes.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:20.78,2:29:22.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还以为他把你娶到手了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thought he might've snagged you.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:22.50,2:29:24.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，恐怕没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I'm afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:26.21,2:29:30.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斯莱德中校曾在林登·约翰逊的幕僚班子，唐斯小姐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel Slade was on Lyndon Johnson's staff, Miss Downes.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:30.30,2:29:32.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？真有意思。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Were you? Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:32.63,2:29:35.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们该找个时间聚聚，聊聊政治。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We should get together, talk politics sometime.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:39.22,2:29:41.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“岩间之花”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fleurs de Rocaille.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:42.72,2:29:43.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:45.39,2:29:47.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“溪边之花。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Flowers from a brook."
Dialogue: 0,2:29:49.23,2:29:50.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:54.28,2:29:58.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好啦，唐斯小姐，我知道上哪儿找你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, Miss Downes, I'll know where to find you.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:00.28,2:30:01.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:01.99,2:30:03.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见，唐斯小姐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bye, Miss Downes.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:03.33,2:30:04.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:07.83,2:30:10.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不用告诉我，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't have to tell me, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:10.96,2:30:12.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一米七，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}5'7",
Dialogue: 0,2:30:13.63,2:30:15.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}红褐色头发，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}auburn hair,
Dialogue: 0,2:30:16.30,2:30:18.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}漂亮的棕色眼睛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}beautiful brown eyes.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:37.61,2:30:39.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呀吧嗒吧嘟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yabba-dabba-doo.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:40.70,2:30:41.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ha!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:43.99,2:30:45.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}曼尼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Manny.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:47.83,2:30:49.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，中校，这太多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Colonel, this is too much.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:49.37,2:30:50.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别客气，这是你应得的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Never mind, you earned it.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:51.04,2:30:52.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下次查理和我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Next time Charlie and I
Dialogue: 0,2:30:52.54,2:30:55.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想去纽约透透气，就给你打电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}want to take a breather to New York, we're gonna Call you.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:55.63,2:30:57.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你来回都开车送我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can drive us both ways.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:57.38,2:30:58.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说定了，中校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're on, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:58.88,2:31:01.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不光是我的荣幸，我还给你打折。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not only will it be an honor, I'll give you a rate.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:02.01,2:31:04.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你打折，我就加小费。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll see your rate and raise you.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:04.64,2:31:06.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别往危险里凑，曼尼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stay outta harm's way, Manny.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:06.43,2:31:07.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}保重，中校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take care, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:07.68,2:31:08.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You, too.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:09.69,2:31:12.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-准备好了？  -没有。接下来交给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Ready?   -No. I'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:13.31,2:31:14.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你先走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:14.77,2:31:17.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}曼尼会开车送你回宿舍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Manny'll drive you to your dorm.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:18.32,2:31:21.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}圣诞节回家前过来坐坐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come by before you go home for Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:21.28,2:31:23.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们喝一杯暖暖身子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll have a little cheer.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:23.41,2:31:25.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是愿意，就留下吃晚饭。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And if you like, stay for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:26.08,2:31:28.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她有时候会做炖肉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sometimes she cooks a pot roast.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:29.12,2:31:30.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}差不多能入口。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's almost edible.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:32.21,2:31:34.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好的，中校。那真是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, Colonel. That'd be really...
Dialogue: 0,2:31:34.84,2:31:36.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bye, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:56.23,2:31:59.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁在那儿？是你吗，弗兰辛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's there? That you, Francine?
Dialogue: 0,2:31:59.99,2:32:00.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:01.07,2:32:02.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:02.45,2:32:04.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}兜风。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Taking a ride.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:04.45,2:32:05.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}兜风？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Taking a ride?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:06.16,2:32:08.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不如你捎我一段？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What about you giving me a lift?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:08.45,2:32:09.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:09.70,2:32:10.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:11.37,2:32:13.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，弗兰辛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, Francine.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:13.54,2:32:16.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们该和好了。你不觉得现在该和好了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We should make up. Don't you think it's time we made up?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:17.17,2:32:18.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:18.46,2:32:20.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-弗兰辛？  -干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Francine?   -What?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:20.38,2:32:25.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗兰克舅舅这个感恩节过得可够呛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uncle Frank's had a really hard Thanksgiving weekend.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:27.35,2:32:29.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是什么？我听见花栗鼠了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's that? I hear a chipmunk.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:30.39,2:32:32.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是海象吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is it a walrus?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:32.56,2:32:34.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，是威利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, it's Willie.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:34.48,2:32:37.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}威利，你来帮我拿包好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Willie, why don't you help me with my bag?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:37.48,2:32:39.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来，孩子。帮我拿包。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, son. Help me with my bag.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:40.11,2:32:42.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来。来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:42.70,2:32:46.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿住了。抓紧。你真有力气。来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got it. Hold onto it. You're strong. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:48.62,2:32:50.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:51.41,2:32:53.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗兰辛，跟我和威利一起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Francine, come on with me and Willie.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:54.21,2:32:56.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我让你给我做棉花糖热巧克力。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll let you make me some marshmallow chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:57.00,2:32:58.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:58.92,2:32:59.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good!
